INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('incursa/workbench/workbench-sync', 'workbench-sync', 'incursa', 'workbench', 'community', 'workbench-sync incursa workbench community adr automation cli docs dotnet-tool github task-tracking workflow workbench-sync is a CLI tool that manages work items and docs, syncing them with GitHub issues, branches, and PRs. It benefits developers and teams using GitHub for project management. Workbench-sync是一种CLI工具，用于管理工作项和文档，并将其与GitHub问题、分支和PR同步 Workbench-syncは、CLIツールを使用して作業項目とドキュメントを管理し、GitHubの問題、ブランチ、PRと同期する Workbench-sync는 CLI 도구를 사용하여 작업 항목과 문서를 관리하고 GitHub 문제, 브랜치, PR과 동기화하는 도구입니다 Workbench-sync es una herramienta de línea de comandos que gestiona elementos de trabajo y documentos, y los sincroniza con GitHub. Permite la importación de problemas de GitHub y la creación de ramas para elementos de trabajo activos Workbench-sync est un outil en ligne de commande qui gère les éléments de travail et les documents, et les synchronise avec GitHub. Il permet l''importation de problèmes GitHub et la création de branches pour les éléments de travail actifs Workbench-sync ist ein Kommandozeilen-Tool, das Arbeitsartikel und Dokumente verwaltet und mit GitHub synchronisiert. Es ermöglicht die Importierung von GitHub-Problemen und die Erstellung von Branches für aktive Arbeitsartikel O workbench-sync é uma ferramenta de linha de comando que sincroniza itens de trabalho e documentos com o GitHub, incluindo specs e ADRs. Workbench-sync — это инструмент командной строки, который синхронизирует задачи и документы с GitHub, включая спецификации и ADR. workbench-sync هو أداة سطر أوامر لمزامنة عناصر العمل والوثائق مع GitHub، بما في ذلك المواصفات وADR. how to use workbench-sync workbench-sync setup guide workbench-sync vs git workbench-sync install github issue sync workbench-sync alternative workbench-sync documentation what is workbench-sync workbench-sync tutorial Workbench-sync GitHub同步 工作项管理 文档管理 CLI工具 Dotnet工具 GitHub问题管理 任务跟踪 工作流管理 Imports missing GitHub issues into local work items using the `.workbench/config.json` file Creates missing GitHub issues for active work items and branches Syncs doc backlinks and front matter using the `workbench.ps1 sync` command Supports dry-run sync using the `--dry-run` flag Requires `gh auth login` for authentication before syncing issues Configures core workflows using settings like `github.owner` and `git.defaultBaseBranch` workbench-sync is a command-line interface (CLI) tool that synchronizes local work items and documentation with GitHub issues, branches, and pull requests.');
