pt":"O que é GitHub Workflow? É uma habilidade que fornece operações GitHub simplificadas com o servidor MCP local","ru":"Что такое GitHub Workflow? Это навык, который обеспечивает упрощенные операции GitHub с помощью локального сервера MCP","ar":"ما هو سير عمل GitHub? هو مهارة توفر عمليات GitHub المبسطة مع خادم MCP المحلي"},"features":{"en":["Utilizes the local GitHub MCP server via @modelcontextprotocol/server-github","Supports configuration through opencode.json files","Enables repository operations using the ''github'' command","Requires a GitHub personal access token for authentication","Compatible with bun and x commands for execution","Allows for environment variable setup, including GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN"],"zh":["支持本地 GitHub MCP 服务器","需要在 opencode.json 中配置 GitHub MCP","支持 Repository 操作","使用 GitHub 个人访问令牌进行认证"],"ja":["ローカル GitHub MCP サーバーをサポート","opencode.json に GitHub MCP を設定する必要があります","リポジトリ操作をサポート","GitHub 個人アクセストークンを使用して認証"],"ko":["로컬 GitHub MCP 서버를 지원","opencode.json에 GitHub MCP를 설정해야 합니다","리포지토리 연산을 지원","GitHub 개인 접근 토큰을 사용하여 인증"],"es":["Configuración de MCP en opencode.json","Uso de servidor local GitHub MCP","Operaciones de repositorio con github","Autenticación con token de acceso personal","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Soporte para operaciones de GitHub avanzadas"],"fr":["Configuration de MCP dans opencode.json","Utilisation du serveur local GitHub MCP","Opérations de référentiel avec github","Authentification avec jeton d''accès personnel","Intégration avec des outils de développement","Prise en charge des opérations GitHub avancées"],"de":["MCP-Konfiguration in opencode.json","Verwendung des lokalen GitHub-MCP-Servers","Repository-Operationen mit github","Authentifizierung mit persönlichem Zugriffstoken","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Unterstützung für erweiterte GitHub-Operationen"],"pt":["Suporte ao servidor MCP local","Operações de repositório com `github`","Configuração via `opencode.json`","Suporte à autenticação com token de acesso pessoal","Integração com o comando `bun`"],"ru":["Поддержка локального сервера MCP","Операции с репозиторием с помощью `github`","Конфигурация через `opencode.json`","Поддержка аутентификации с помощью личного токена доступа","Интеграция с командой `bun`"],"ar":["دعم خادم MCP المحلي","عمليات مستودع مع `github`","تكوين عبر `opencode.json`","دعم التحقق مع رمز الوصول الشخصي","التكامل مع الأمر `bun`"]},"keywords":{"en":["github-workflow setup guide","what is github-workflow","github-workflow alternative","github-workflow vs gitflow","how to use github-workflow with AI agents","github-workflow install for developers","github-workflow tutorial for AI coding","github-workflow and Model Context Protocol","streamlining github workflow with AI"],"zh":["GitHub 工作流","AI 工具","GitHub MCP 服务器","OpenCode JSON","GitHub 个人访问令牌","Repository 操作"],"ja":["GitHub ワークフロー","AI エージェント","GitHub MCP サーバー","OpenCode JSON","GitHub 個人アクセストークン","リポジトリ操作"],"ko":["GitHub 워크플로우","AI 툴","GitHub MCP 서버","OpenCode JSON","GitHub 개인 접근 토큰","리포지토리 연산"],"es":["github-workflow","Agentes de Código AI","configuración de MCP","operaciones de GitHub","token de acceso personal","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","integración con GitHub"],"fr":["github-workflow","Agents de Codage IA","configuration de MCP","opérations GitHub","jeton d''accès personnel","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","intégration avec GitHub"],"de":["github-workflow","AI-Coding-Agenten","MCP-Konfiguration","GitHub-Operationen","persönliches Zugriffstoken","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Integration mit GitHub"],"pt":["github workflow","ferramentas de ia","servidor mcp local","opencode json","autenticação github","bun comando","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["github workflow","ии агенты","локальный сервер mcp","opencode json","аутентификация github","команда bun","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["سير عمل github","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","خادم mcp المحلي","opencode json","التحقق من github","أمر bun","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"jaraim","repo":"opencode-chinese","repoPath":"jaraim/opencode-chinese","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.264Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-workflow","description":"Use local GitHub MCP server for common GitHub workflows and automation","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Workflow Skill\n\nLeverage the local GitHub MCP server (`@modelcontextprotocol/server-github`) for streamlined GitHub operations.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nEnsure GitHub MCP is configured in `opencode.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcp\": {\n    \"Github\": {\n      \"type\": \"local\",\n      \"command\": [\"bun\", \"x\", \"@modelcontextprotocol/server-github\"],\n      \"environment\": {\n        \"GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN\": \"your-token\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Available MCP Tools\n\n### Repository Operations\n\n- `github","body":"# GitHub Workflow Skill\n\nLeverage the local GitHub MCP server (`@modelcontextprotocol/server-github`) for streamlined GitHub operations.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nEnsure GitHub MCP is configured in `opencode.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcp\": {\n    \"Github\": {\n      \"type\": \"local\",\n      \"command\": [\"bun\", \"x\", \"@modelcontextprotocol/server-github\"],\n      \"environment\": {\n        \"GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN\": \"your-token\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Available MCP Tools\n\n### Repository Operations\n\n- `github_search_repositories` - Search GitHub repos\n- `github_get_repository` - Get repo details\n- `github_create_repository` - Create new repo\n- `github_fork_repository` - Fork a repo\n\n### Issue Management\n\n- `github_list_issues` - List repo issues\n- `github_create_issue` - Create new issue\n- `github_update_issue` - Update existing issue\n- `github_get_issue` - Get issue details\n- `github_add_issue_comment` - Comment on issue\n\n### Pull Request Operations\n\n- `github_list_pull_requests` - List PRs\n- `github_create_pull_request` - Create PR\n- `github_get_pull_request` - Get PR details\n- `github_update_pull_request` - Update PR\n- `github_merge_pull_request` - Merge PR\n- `github_get_pull_request_files` - List changed files\n\n### Code Operations\n\n- `github_search_code` - Search code across repos\n- `github_get_file_contents` - Get file content\n- `github_create_or_update_file` - Create/update file\n- `github_push_files` - Push multiple files\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### Workflow 1: Create Bug Report\n\n```\n1. github_create_issue\n   - owner: repo owner\n   - repo: repository name\n   - title: \"[Bug] Brief description\"\n   - body: Detailed bug report\n   - labels: [\"bug\"]\n```\n\n### Workflow 2: Review and Merge PR\n\n```\n1. github_get_pull_request - Get PR details\n2. github_get_pull_request_files - Review changes\n3. github_create_pull_request_review - Submit review\n4. github_merge_pull_request - Merge if approved\n```\n\n### Workflow 3: Quick Fix & PR\n\n```\n1. Edit files locally\n2. git add & git commit\n3. git push\n4. github_create_pull_request\n   - title: \"Fix: Description\"\n   - body: Change summary\n   - head: feature-branch\n   - base: main\n```\n\n### Workflow 4: Find Issues to Contribute\n\n```\n1. github_search_repositories - Find interesting repos\n2. github_list_issues - Filter by \"good first issue\" or \"help wanted\"\n3. github_fork_repository - Fork the repo\n4. git clone & work locally\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use descriptive titles** - Include type prefix like `[Bug]`, `[Feature]`, `[Docs]`\n2. **Reference issues** - Use `Fixes #123` or `Closes #456` in PR descriptions\n3. **Review before merge** - Always review PRs before merging\n4. **Use labels** - Categorize issues with appropriate labels\n5. **Protect main branch** - Require PR reviews before merging to main\n\n## Environment Variables\n\nThe MCP server requires:\n\n- `GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN` - GitHub personal access token with appropriate scopes\n\nToken scopes needed:\n\n- `repo` - Full repository access\n- `read:user` - Read user profile\n- `read:org` - Read organization data\n\n## Examples\n\n**Find popular repos:**\n\n```\nSearch for \"machine learning\" repos with most stars\n→ github_search_repositories\n  query: \"machine learning language:python stars:>1000\"\n  sort: \"stars\"\n```\n\n**Create feature request:**\n\n```\nCreate issue for new feature\n→ github_create_issue\n  owner: \"anomalyco\"\n  repo: \"opencode\"\n  title: \"[Feature] Add dark mode toggle\"\n  body: \"## Description\\nAdd a toggle for dark mode...\"\n  labels: [\"enhancement\"]\n```\n\n**Review pending PR:**\n\n```\nReview PR #42\n→ github_get_pull_request\n  owner: \"anomalyco\"\n  repo: \"opencode\"\n  pull_number: 42\n→ github_get_pull_request_files (same params)\n→ github_create_pull_request_review\n  event: \"APPROVE\"\n  body: \"LGTM! Great work.\"\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T01:59:47.905Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agent Developers leveraging GitHub operations, streamlining repository management with local GitHub MCP server integration.","zh":"适合使用 GitHub 操作的 AI Agent 开发人员，通过本地 GitHub MCP 服务器集成简化仓库管理。","ja":"GitHub 操作を利用する AI エージェント開発者に最適です。ローカルの GitHub MCP サーバーを統合してリポジトリ管理を簡素化します。","ko":"GitHub 운영을 사용하는 AI 에이전트 개발자에게 적합합니다. 로컬 GitHub MCP 서버를 통합하여 리포지토리 관리를 간소화합니다.","es":"Ideal para desarrolladores de agentes de IA que utilizan operaciones de GitHub, simplificando la gestión de repositorios con integración de servidor GitHub MCP local.","fr":"Idéal pour les développeurs d''agents IA qui utilisent les opérations GitHub, simplifiant la gestion des référentiels avec l''intégration du serveur GitHub MCP local.","de":"Ideal für AI-Agent-Entwickler, die GitHub-Operationen nutzen, um die Repository-Verwaltung mit lokaler GitHub-MCP-Server-Integration zu vereinfachen.","pt":"Ideal para desenvolvedores de Agentes de IA que utilizam operações do GitHub, otimizando a gestão de repositórios com integração do servidor GitHub MCP local.","ru":"Идеально подходит для разработчиков агентов ИИ, использующих операции GitHub, оптимизируя управление репозиториями с интеграцией локального сервера GitHub MCP.","ar":"مثالية لمطوري وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يستفيدون من عمليات GitHub، وتبسيط إدارة المستودعات من خلال دمج خادم GitHub MCP المحلي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform streamlined GitHub operations, including repository management, using the local GitHub MCP server and @modelcontextprotocol/server-github, while securely handling GitHub personal access tokens.","zh":"赋予代理执行简化的 GitHub 操作的能力，包括使用本地 GitHub MCP 服务器和 @modelcontextprotocol/server-github 的仓库管理，同时安全地处理 GitHub 个人访问令牌。","ja":"エージェントがローカルの GitHub MCP サーバーと @modelcontextprotocol/server-github を使用して、GitHub の操作（リポジトリ管理など）を簡素化し、GitHub の個人アクセストークンを安全に処理できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 로컬 GitHub MCP 서버와 @modelcontextprotocol/server-github를 사용하여 GitHub 운영(리포지토리 관리 등)을 간소화하고 GitHub 개인 액세스 토큰을 안전하게 처리할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes realizar operaciones de GitHub simplificadas, incluyendo la gestión de repositorios, utilizando el servidor GitHub MCP local y @modelcontextprotocol/server-github, mientras maneja de forma segura los tokens de acceso personal de GitHub.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des opérations GitHub simplifiées, notamment la gestion des référentiels, en utilisant le serveur GitHub MCP local et @modelcontextprotocol/server-github, tout en gérant de manière sécurisée les jetons d''accès personnel GitHub.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, GitHub-Operationen zu vereinfachen, einschließlich Repository-Verwaltung, unter Verwendung des lokalen GitHub-MCP-Servers und @modelcontextprotocol/server-github, während sie GitHub-Personal-Access-Tokens sicher verwalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar operações do GitHub de forma otimizada, incluindo a gestão de repositórios, usando o servidor GitHub MCP local e @modelcontextprotocol/server-github, enquanto lida de forma segura com tokens de acesso pessoal do GitHub.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять оптимизированные операции GitHub, включая управление репозиториями, используя локальный сервер GitHub MCP и @modelcontextprotocol/server-github, а также безопасно обрабатывает личные токены доступа GitHub.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من أداء عمليات GitHub المُبسطة، بما في ذلك إدارة المستودعات، باستخدام خادم GitHub MCP المحلي و @modelcontextprotocol/server-github، مع التعامل الآمن مع رموز الوصول الشخصية إلى GitHub."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating repository creation and management","Streamlining GitHub workflow operations with MCP tools","Debugging GitHub repository issues using local MCP server"],"zh":["自动化仓库创建和管理","使用 MCP 工具简化 GitHub 工作流操作","使用本地 MCP 服务器调试 GitHub 仓库问题"],"ja":["リポジトリの作成と管理の自動化","MCP ツールを使用して GitHub ワークフロー操作を簡素化する","ローカルの MCP サーバーを使用して GitHub リポジトリの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["리포지토리 생성 및 관리 자동화","MCP 도구를 사용하여 GitHub 워크플로우 운영을 간소화하는 것","로컬 MCP 서버를 사용하여 GitHub 리포지토리 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la creación y gestión de repositorios","Simplificar las operaciones de flujo de trabajo de GitHub con herramientas MCP","Depurar problemas de repositorio de GitHub utilizando el servidor MCP local"],"fr":["Automatiser la création et la gestion des référentiels","Simplifier les opérations de workflow GitHub avec des outils MCP","Déboguer les problèmes de référentiel GitHub en utilisant le serveur MCP local"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung und Verwaltung von Repositories","Vereinfachung der GitHub-Workflow-Operationen mit MCP-Tools","Fehlerbehebung bei GitHub-Repository-Problemen mithilfe des lokalen MCP-Servers"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação e gestão de repositórios","Otimizar operações de fluxo de trabalho do GitHub com ferramentas MCP","Depurar problemas de repositório do GitHub usando o servidor MCP local"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание и управление репозиториями","Оптимизировать операции рабочего процесса GitHub с помощью инструментов MCP","Отладить проблемы репозитория GitHub с помощью локального сервера MCP"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء وإدارة المستودعات","تبسيط عمليات سير عمل GitHub باستخدام أدوات MCP","تصحيح أخطاء مستودع GitHub باستخدام خادم MCP المحلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub MCP configuration in opencode.json","Needs a GitHub personal access token for environment setup","Dependent on @modelcontextprotocol/server-github package"],"zh":["需要在 opencode.json 中配置 GitHub MCP","需要 GitHub 个人访问令牌来设置环境","依赖于 @modelcontextprotocol/server-github 包"],"ja":["opencode.json に GitHub MCP を設定する必要がある","環境設定には GitHub 個人アクセストークンが必要","@modelcontextprotocol/server-github パッケージに依存する"],"ko":["opencode.json에 GitHub MCP를 구성해야 함","환경 설정에는 GitHub 개인 액세스 토큰이 필요함","@modelcontextprotocol/server-github 패키지에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere configuración de GitHub MCP en opencode.json","Necesita un token de acceso personal de GitHub para la configuración del entorno","Dependiente del paquete @modelcontextprotocol/server-github"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration GitHub MCP dans opencode.json","Nécessite un jeton d''accès personnel GitHub pour la configuration de l''environnement","Dépend du paquet @modelcontextprotocol/server-github"],"de":["Benötigt GitHub-MCP-Konfiguration in opencode.json","Benötigt ein GitHub-Personal-Access-Token für die Umgebungssetup","Abhängig vom Paket @modelcontextprotocol/server-github"],"pt":["Requer configuração do GitHub MCP em opencode.json","Necessita de um token de acesso pessoal do GitHub para configuração do ambiente","Depende do pacote @modelcontextprotocol/server-github"],"ru":["Требует настройки GitHub MCP в opencode.json","Требует личного токена доступа GitHub для настройки среды","Зависит от пакета @modelcontextprotocol/server-github"],"ar":["يتطلب تكوين GitHub MCP في opencode.json","يحتاج إلى رمز وصول شخصي إلى GitHub لإعداد البيئة","يعتمد على حزمة @modelcontextprotocol/server-github"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"697f501b0f106025facdb50ae3c90ae1d9e3b6214f6c82e7b2f8f525a4cba601","qualityScore":51}');
