INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('jaraim/opencode-chinese/github-workflow', 'github-workflow', 'jaraim', 'opencode-chinese', 'community', 'github-workflow jaraim opencode-chinese community The github-workflow skill leverages the local GitHub MCP server for streamlined GitHub operations, benefiting AI agent developers with efficient repository management. GitHub 工作流 Skill 利用本地 GitHub MCP 服务器实现 GitHub 操作的流程化。需要在 opencode.json 中配置 GitHub MCP GitHub ワークフロー スキルは、ローカル GitHub MCP サーバーを使用して GitHub 操作をストリームライン化します。opencode.json に GitHub MCP を設定する必要があります GitHub 워크플로우 스킬은 로컬 GitHub MCP 서버를 사용하여 GitHub 연산을 최적화합니다. opencode.json에 GitHub MCP를 설정해야 합니다 El skill github-workflow permite operaciones de GitHub optimizadas con la configuración de MCP en opencode.json Le skill github-workflow permet des opérations GitHub optimisées avec la configuration de MCP dans opencode.json Das github-workflow-Skill ermöglicht optimierte GitHub-Operationen durch die MCP-Konfiguration in opencode.json O GitHub Workflow é uma habilidade que permite operações GitHub simplificadas com o servidor MCP local GitHub Workflow - это навык, который позволяет упростить операции GitHub с помощью локального сервера MCP سير عمل GitHub هو مهارة تمكن من عمليات GitHub المبسطة مع خادم MCP المحلي github-workflow setup guide what is github-workflow github-workflow alternative github-workflow vs gitflow how to use github-workflow with AI agents github-workflow install for developers github-workflow tutorial for AI coding github-workflow and Model Context Protocol streamlining github workflow with AI GitHub 工作流 AI 工具 GitHub MCP 服务器 OpenCode JSON GitHub 个人访问令牌 Repository 操作 Utilizes the local GitHub MCP server via @modelcontextprotocol/server-github Supports configuration through opencode.json files Enables repository operations using the ''github'' command Requires a GitHub personal access token for authentication Compatible with bun and x commands for execution Allows for environment variable setup, including GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN github-workflow is a skill that integrates with the local GitHub Model Context Protocol (MCP) server for optimized GitHub workflow management.');
