ンストールするためのコマンドラインツールの一種です","ko":"uv-python-tool-installer는 uv를 사용하여 Python 툴을 설치하는 명령줄 툴입니다","es":"uv-python-tool-installer es una herramienta de línea de comandos que facilita la instalación de paquetes Python de PyPI.","fr":"uv-python-tool-installer est un outil en ligne de commande qui facilite l''installation de packages Python de PyPI.","de":"uv-python-tool-installer ist ein Kommandozeilentool, das die Installation von Python-Paketen aus PyPI erleichtert.","pt":"O que é uv-python-tool-installer? É uma ferramenta de instalação de pacotes Python","ru":"Что такое uv-python-tool-installer? Это инструмент для установки пакетов Python","ar":"ما هو مثبت uv-python-tool-installer? هو أداة تثبيت حزم بايثون"},"features":{"en":["Installs PyPI packages using a single command via curl or powershell","Supports installation on macOS, Linux, and Windows platforms","Allows installation of specific package versions","Utilizes the uv library for simplified package management","Enables quick installation of tools like ruff using a simple command"],"zh":["支持macOS、Linux和Windows平台","使用uv安装Python工具","提供快速安装和版本管理功能","支持PyPI包安装","支持指定版本安装"],"ja":["macOS、Linux、Windowsプラットフォームをサポート","uvを使用してPythonツールをインストール","迅速なインストールとバージョン管理機能を提供","PyPIパッケージのインストールをサポート","指定バージョンのインストールをサポート"],"ko":["macOS, Linux, Windows 플랫폼을 지원","uv를 사용하여 Python 툴을 설치","빠른 설치 및 버전 관리 기능을 제공","PyPI 패키지 설치를 지원","지정 버전 설치를 지원"],"es":["Instalación de herramientas Python con un solo comando","Compatibilidad con macOS, Linux y Windows","Soporte para la instalación de versiones específicas de paquetes","Uso de uv para una instalación segura y confiable","Facilidad de uso con una sintaxis de comando simple"],"fr":["Installation d''outils Python avec une seule commande","Compatibilité avec macOS, Linux et Windows","Prise en charge de l''installation de versions spécifiques de packages","Utilisation de uv pour une installation sécurisée et fiable","Facilité d''utilisation avec une syntaxe de commande simple"],"de":["Installation von Python-Tools mit einem einzigen Befehl","Kompatibilität mit macOS, Linux und Windows","Unterstützung für die Installation spezifischer Versionen von Paketen","Verwendung von uv für eine sichere und zuverlässige Installation","Einfache Bedienung mit einer einfachen Befehlssyntax"],"pt":["Instalação de pacotes Python com um único comando","Suporte a macOS, Linux e Windows","Instalação de versões específicas de pacotes","Uso do uv para instalação de pacotes","Comandos personalizados para instalação"],"ru":["Установка пакетов Python с помощью одного команды","Поддержка macOS, Linux и Windows","Установка конкретных версий пакетов","Использование uv для установки пакетов","Пользовательские команды для установки"],"ar":["تثبيت حزم بايثون بأمر واحد","دعم macOS، Linux و Windows","تثبيت إصدارات معينة من الحزم","استخدام uv لتثبيت الحزم","أوامر مخصصة للتثبيت"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use uv-python-tool-installer","uv-python-tool-installer setup guide","uv-python-tool-installer alternative","uv-python-tool-installer vs pip","install uv-python-tool-installer","uv-python-tool-installer tutorial","what is uv-python-tool-installer","uv-python-tool-installer documentation","uv-python-tool-installer install PyPI packages"],"zh":["uv-python-tool-installer","Python工具安装","uv安装","PyPI包安装","指定版本安装","macOS安装Python工具","Linux安装Python工具","Windows安装Python工具"],"ja":["uv-python-tool-installer","Pythonツールのインストール","uvのインストール","PyPIパッケージのインストール","指定バージョンのインストール","macOSでPythonツールをインストール","LinuxでPythonツールをインストール","WindowsでPythonツールをインストール"],"ko":["uv-python-tool-installer","Python 툴 설치","uv 설치","PyPI 패키지 설치","지정 버전 설치","macOS에서 Python 툴 설치","Linux에서 Python 툴 설치","Windows에서 Python 툴 설치"],"es":["instalador de herramientas python","uv python tool installer","instalación de paquetes python","herramientas de desarrollo python","instalador de paquetes pypi","uv para desarrollo python"],"fr":["installateur d''outils python","uv python tool installer","installation de packages python","outils de développement python","installateur de packages pypi","uv pour le développement python"],"de":["installer für python-tools","uv python tool installer","installation von python-paketen","entwicklungstools für python","installer für pypi-pakete","uv für python-entwicklung"],"pt":["instalador de ferramentas python","uv python tool installer","instalação de pacotes python","ferramentas de desenvolvimento python","uv python","instalador de pacotes python","desenvolvimento de software python"],"ru":["установщик инструментов python","uv python tool installer","установка пакетов python","инструменты разработки python","uv python","установщик пакетов python","разработка программного обеспечения python"],"ar":["مثبت أدوات بايثون","uv python tool installer","تثبيت حزم بايثون","أدوات تطوير بايثون","uv python","مثبت حزم بايثون","تطوير برامج بايثون"]}},"owner":"aresbit","repo":"MateBot","repoPath":"aresbit/MateBot","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.271Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"uv-python-tool-installer","description":"Install Python command-line tools with a single command using uvx.sh (Astrals uv-based installer). Use when you need to install Python tools like ruff, black, mypy, or any PyPI package as a command-line tool. This skill provides simple curl commands for installing Python tools on macOS, Linux, and Windows.","bodyPreview":"# Uv Python Tool Installer\n\nInstall Python tools with a single command. Powered by [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/).\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### macOS and Linux\n\n```bash\ncurl -LsSf uvx.sh/<package>/install.sh | sh\n```\n\nReplace `<package>` with any PyPI package name.\n\n### Windows\n\n```bash\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy ByPass -c \"irm https://uvx.sh/<package>/install.ps1 | iex\"\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Install ruff\n\n```bash\ncurl -LsSf uvx.sh/ruff/install.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install a specific version\n\n```bash\ncur","body":"# Uv Python Tool Installer\n\nInstall Python tools with a single command. Powered by [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/).\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### macOS and Linux\n\n```bash\ncurl -LsSf uvx.sh/<package>/install.sh | sh\n```\n\nReplace `<package>` with any PyPI package name.\n\n### Windows\n\n```bash\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy ByPass -c \"irm https://uvx.sh/<package>/install.ps1 | iex\"\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Install ruff\n\n```bash\ncurl -LsSf uvx.sh/ruff/install.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install a specific version\n\n```bash\ncurl -LsSf uvx.sh/ruff/0.8.3/install.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Passing arguments\n\n```bash\n# Force installation\ncurl -LsSf uvx.sh/ruff/install.sh | sh -s -- --force\n\n# Install from a specific index\ncurl -LsSf uvx.sh/cmake/install.sh | sh -s -- --index https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu\n```\n\n## Scripts\n\n### `install.sh`\n\nSimple bash script to install Python tools:\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# Install Python tools using uvx.sh\n# Usage: ./install.sh <package> [version] [--force] [--index URL]\n\nPACKAGE=$1\nVERSION=$2\nshift 2\n\nif [ -n \"$VERSION\" ]; then\n    URL=\"https://uvx.sh/${PACKAGE}/${VERSION}/install.sh\"\nelse\n    URL=\"https://uvx.sh/${PACKAGE}/install.sh\"\nfi\n\ncurl -LsSf \"$URL\" | sh -s -- \"$@\"\n```\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\n./scripts/install.sh ruff\n./scripts/install.sh ruff 0.8.3\n./scripts/install.sh ruff 0.8.3 --force\n```\n\n## Common Python Tools\n\n- `ruff` - Fast Python linter\n- `black` - Python code formatter  \n- `mypy` - Static type checker\n- `httpie` - Modern HTTP client\n- `pipx` - Install and run Python applications in isolated environments\n- `jupyter` - Jupyter notebooks\n- `poetry` - Python dependency management\n\n## Notes\n\n- Tools are installed to `~/.local/bin` by default\n- Ensure `~/.local/bin` is in your PATH\n- Uses `uv` under the hood for fast, reliable installation\n- Works with any PyPI package that provides command-line tools\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:13.358Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Development Agents needing streamlined package installation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要简化包安装功能的Python开发代理。","ja":"Python開発エージェントがストリームライン化されたパッケージのインストール機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"패키지 설치 기능을 간소화해야 하는 Python 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de Python que necesitan capacidades de instalación de paquetes simplificadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Python nécessitant des capacités d''installation de packages simplifiées.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Entwicklungsagenten, die vereinfachte Paketinstallationsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Python que necessitam de capacidades de instalação de pacotes otimizadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Python, которым требуются оптимизированные возможности установки пакетов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير بايثون الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات تثبيت الحزمة المُستَهمَلة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to effortlessly install Python tools via command-line interfaces, leveraging PyPI packages and supporting macOS, Linux, and Windows environments through curl and powershell scripts.","zh":"赋予代理通过命令行界面轻松安装Python工具的能力，利用PyPI包，并通过curl和powershell脚本支持macOS、Linux和Windows环境。","ja":"エージェントがコマンドラインインターフェイスを介してPythonツールを簡単にインストールできるようにし、PyPIパッケージを利用し、curlおよびpowershellスクリプトを介してmacOS、Linux、Windows環境をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 명령 줄 인터페이스를 통해 Python 도구를 쉽게 설치할 수 있도록 하며, PyPI 패키지를 이용하여 curl 및 powershell 스크립트를 통해 macOS, Linux 및 Windows 환경을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a instalar herramientas de Python de forma sencilla a través de interfaces de línea de comandos, aprovechando los paquetes de PyPI y admitiendo entornos macOS, Linux y Windows a través de scripts de curl y powershell.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''installer des outils Python en toute simplicité via des interfaces de ligne de commande, en exploitant les packages PyPI et en prenant en charge les environnements macOS, Linux et Windows via des scripts curl et powershell.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Python-Tools mühelos über Kommandozeilen-Schnittstellen zu installieren, indem es PyPI-Pakete nutzt und macOS-, Linux- und Windows-Umgebungen über curl- und powershell-Skripte unterstützt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a instalar ferramentas Python sem esforço via interfaces de linha de comando, aproveitando pacotes PyPI e suportando ambientes macOS, Linux e Windows por meio de scripts curl e powershell.","ru":"Позволяет агентам легко устанавливать инструменты Python через командные интерфейсы, используя пакеты PyPI и поддерживая среды macOS, Linux и Windows через скрипты curl и powershell.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تثبيت أدوات بايثون بلا مجهود عبر واجهات سطر الأوامر، مستفيدًا من حزم PyPI ودعم بيئات macOS و Linux و Windows من خلال سكريبتات curl و powershell."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating ruff installations for code linting","Installing specific versions of Python packages for compatibility testing","Streamlining development workflows with one-command tool installations"],"zh":["自动化ruff安装以进行代码linting","安装特定版本的Python包以进行兼容性测试","使用一键式工具安装简化开发工作流"],"ja":["コードlintingのためのruffインストールの自動化","互換性テストのための特定バージョンのPythonパッケージのインストール","ワンコマンドツールインストールによる開発ワークフローの簡素化"],"ko":["코드 linting을 위한 ruff 설치 자동화","호환성 테스트를 위한 특정 버전의 Python 패키지 설치","하나의 명령어로 도구 설치를 통해 개발 워크플로우를 간소화"],"es":["Automatizar instalaciones de ruff para la verificación de código","Instalar versiones específicas de paquetes de Python para pruebas de compatibilidad","Optimizar flujos de trabajo de desarrollo con instalaciones de herramientas de un solo comando"],"fr":["Automatiser les installations de ruff pour le débogage de code","Installer des versions spécifiques de packages Python pour des tests de compatibilité","Optimiser les flux de travail de développement avec des installations d''outils en un seul commande"],"de":["Automatisieren von ruff-Installationen für Code-Linter","Installieren spezifischer Versionen von Python-Paketen für Kompatibilitätstests","Optimieren von Entwicklungsworkflows mit Tool-Installationen in einem einzigen Befehl"],"pt":["Automatizar instalações ruff para análise de código","Instalar versões específicas de pacotes Python para testes de compatibilidade","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento com instalações de ferramentas de um comando"],"ru":["Автоматизировать установки ruff для анализа кода","Устанавливать конкретные версии пакетов Python для тестирования совместимости","Оптимизировать рабочие процессы разработки с помощью однокомандных установок инструментов"],"ar":["تأتمة تثبيتات ruff لتحليل الشفرة","تثبيت إصدارات محددة من حزم بايثون لاختبار التوافق","تبسيط سير عمل التطوير مع تثبيت أدوات أمر واحد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires internet access for package download","Limited to PyPI packages","Execution policy bypass required on Windows"],"zh":["需要互联网访问以下载包","仅限PyPI包","Windows上需要绕过执行策略"],"ja":["パッケージのダウンロードにはインターネットアクセスが必要","PyPIパッケージのみ","Windowsでは実行ポリシーのバイパスが必要"],"ko":["패키지 다운로드를 위해 인터넷 접근이 필요","PyPI 패키지만 해당","Windows에서 실행 정책 우회가 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a Internet para la descarga de paquetes","Limitado a paquetes de PyPI","Se requiere un bypass de la política de ejecución en Windows"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à Internet pour le téléchargement de packages","Limité aux packages PyPI","Un contournement de la politique d''exécution est requis sous Windows"],"de":["Benötigt Internetzugang für den Download von Paketen","Begrenzt auf PyPI-Pakete","Ein Umgehen der Ausführungsrichtlinie ist unter Windows erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer acesso à internet para download de pacotes","Limitado a pacotes PyPI","Bypass de política de execução necessário no Windows"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к интернету для скачивания пакетов","Ограничен пакетами PyPI","Требуется обход политики выполнения в Windows"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الإنترنت لتحميل الحزم","محدود بحزم PyPI","مطلوب تخطي سياسة التشغيل على نظام Windows"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"d4e9eca89db59d2c63a492211a36d04dd19ec9a60c34a0d093b3f19a37a47a9b","qualityScore":51}');
