fr":"Guide d''installation de wm-git-worktree-manager pour les ...","de":"Einrichtungsleitfaden für wm-git-worktree-manager für Ent...","pt":"Guia de Configuração do wm-git-worktree-manager","ru":"Руководство по настройке wm-git-worktree-manager - ИИ Агенты","ar":"دليل إعداد wm-git-worktree-manager - أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي"},"description":{"en":"Discover how to master git worktree management with wm-git-worktree-manager. Learn to initialize projects and manage worktrees with ease. Get started now!","zh":"了解wm-git-worktree-manager的使用方法，包括初始化项目配置和添加/删除工作树","ja":"wm-git-worktree-managerの使い方を学ぶ、プロジェクト設定の初期化とワークツリーの追加/削除","ko":"wm-git-worktree-manager 사용 방법을 알아보세요, 프로젝트 설정 초기화 및 작업 트리 추가/삭제","es":"Aprende a utilizar wm-git-worktree-manager para gestionar tus proyectos Git de manera efectiva. Descubre sus características y beneficios.","fr":"Découvrez comment utiliser wm-git-worktree-manager pour gérer vos projets Git de manière efficace. Consultez ses fonctionnalités et avantages.","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie wm-git-worktree-manager verwenden können, um Ihre Git-Projekte effektiv zu verwalten. Entdecken Sie seine Funktionen und Vorteile.","pt":"Aprenda a usar o wm-git-worktree-manager para gerenciar worktrees Git de forma eficiente","ru":"Узнайте, как использовать wm-git-worktree-manager для эффективного управления worktrees Git - ИИ Агенты","ar":"تعرف على كيفية استخدام wm-git-worktree-manager لإدارة worktrees Git بفعالية - أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي"},"definition":{"en":"wm-git-worktree-manager is a command-line interface tool designed for managing git worktrees, allowing developers to initialize and manage worktrees using explicit arguments.","zh":"wm-git-worktree-manager是一个用于管理git工作树的CLI工具","ja":"wm-git-worktree-managerは、gitワークツリーを管理するためのCLIツールです","ko":"wm-git-worktree-manager는 git 작업 트리를 관리하는 CLI 툴입니다","es":"wm-git-worktree-manager es una herramienta de gestión de git worktree que permite a los desarrolladores gestionar sus proyectos de manera efectiva.","fr":"wm-git-worktree-manager est un outil de gestion de git worktree qui permet aux développeurs de gérer leurs projets de manière efficace.","de":"wm-git-worktree-manager ist ein Tool für die Verwaltung von git worktree, das es Entwicklern ermöglicht, ihre Projekte effektiv zu verwalten.","pt":"O que é wm-git-worktree-manager? É uma ferramenta CLI para gerenciar worktrees Git","ru":"Что такое wm-git-worktree-manager? Это инструмент CLI для управления worktrees Git - ИИ Агенты","ar":"ما هو wm-git-worktree-manager? هو أداة CLI لدارة worktrees Git - أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي"},"features":{"en":["Initialize project config using the `wm init` command","Add worktrees using the `wm add` command with explicit arguments","Remove worktrees using the `wm remove` command with explicit arguments","Supports non-interactive mode for automated environments","Configures projects using the .wm.yaml file format"],"zh":["支持初始化项目配置（.wm.yaml）","支持添加和删除工作树","提供快速参考命令","支持非交互模式","使用explicit arguments进行操作"],"ja":["プロジェクト設定の初期化（.wm.yaml）をサポート","ワークツリーの追加と削除をサポート","クイックリファレンスコマンドを提供","非交互モードをサポート","explicit argumentsを使用して操作"],"ko":["프로젝트 설정 초기화（.wm.yaml）를 지원","작업 트리 추가 및 삭제를 지원","빠른 참조 명령을 제공","비대화식 모드를 지원","명시적 인수를 사용하여 작업"],"es":["Inicialización de proyectos con ''wm init''","Gestión de configuraciones con archivos .wm.yaml","Soporte para modo no interactivo","Uso de argumentos explícitos para evitar problemas en entornos automatizados","Comandos como ''wm add'' y ''wm remove'' para gestionar worktrees"],"fr":["Initialisation de projets avec ''wm init''","Gestion de configurations avec des fichiers .wm.yaml","Prise en charge du mode non interactif","Utilisation d''arguments explicites pour éviter les problèmes dans les environnements automatisés","Commandes comme ''wm add'' et ''wm remove'' pour gérer les worktrees"],"de":["Initialisierung von Projekten mit ''wm init''","Verwaltung von Konfigurationen mit Dateien .wm.yaml","Unterstützung für nicht-interaktiven Modus","Verwendung von expliziten Argumenten, um Probleme in automatisierten Umgebungen zu vermeiden","Befehle wie ''wm add'' und ''wm remove'' zur Verwaltung von Worktrees"],"pt":["Inicialização de projeto com wm init","Adição de worktrees com wm add","Remoção de worktrees com wm remove","Suporte a modo não interativo","Configuração de projeto com .wm.yaml"],"ru":["Инициализация проекта с wm init","Добавление worktrees с wm add","Удаление worktrees с wm remove","Поддержка неинтерактивного режима","Конфигурация проекта с .wm.yaml - ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["ت�始ياز المشروع مع wm init","إضافة worktrees مع wm add","حذف worktrees مع wm remove","دعم وضع غير تفاعلي","تكوين المشروع مع .wm.yaml - أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use wm-git-worktree-manager","wm-git-worktree-manager setup guide","git worktree management best practices","wm-git-worktree-manager alternative","wm-git-worktree-manager vs git worktree","wm-git-worktree-manager install","wm-git-worktree-manager CLI commands","git worktree manager tool","wm-git-worktree-manager automated environments"],"zh":["wm-git-worktree-manager","git工作树管理","CLI工具","AI工具","项目配置","工作树添加","工作树删除","非交互模式"],"ja":["wm-git-worktree-manager","gitワークツリー管理","CLIツール","AIエージェント","プロジェクト設定","ワークツリー追加","ワークツリー削除","非交互モード"],"ko":["wm-git-worktree-manager","git 작업 트리 관리","CLI 툴","AI 에이전트","프로젝트 설정","작업 트리 추가","작업 트리 삭제","비대화식 모드"],"es":["wm-git-worktree-manager","herramientas de git","gestión de worktree","desarrollo de software","línea de comandos","configuración de proyectos","modos no interactivos","argumentos explícitos"],"fr":["wm-git-worktree-manager","outils de git","gestion de worktree","développement de logiciels","ligne de commande","configuration de projets","modes non interactifs","arguments explicites"],"de":["wm-git-worktree-manager","git-tools","worktree-verwaltung","software-entwicklung","kommandozeile","projekt-konfiguration","nicht-interaktive modi","explizite argumente"],"pt":["wm-git-worktree-manager","gerenciamento de worktrees Git","ferramenta CLI","modo não interativo","configuração de projeto","wm init","wm add","wm remove"],"ru":["wm-git-worktree-manager","управление worktrees Git","инструмент CLI","неинтерактивный режим","конфигурация проекта","wm init","wm add","wm remove - ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["wm-git-worktree-manager","دارة worktrees Git","أداة CLI","وضع غير تفاعلي","تكوين المشروع","wm init","wm add","wm remove - أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي"]}},"owner":"Devdha","repo":"wm","repoPath":"Devdha/wm","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.272Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wm-git-worktree-manager","description":"Use when working with git worktrees - creating isolated workspaces for branches, managing multiple features in parallel, or cleaning up worktrees","bodyPreview":"# WM - Git Worktree Manager\n\nCLI tool for easy git worktree management.\n\n## IMPORTANT: Non-Interactive Mode Required\n\n**Always use explicit arguments. Interactive mode does not work in automated environments.**\n\n```bash\n# CORRECT - explicit arguments\nwm add feature-auth\nwm remove feature-auth\n\n# WRONG - interactive mode (will hang)\nwm add      # NO!\nwm remove   # NO!\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Command | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `wm init` | Initialize project config (.wm.yaml) |","body":"# WM - Git Worktree Manager\n\nCLI tool for easy git worktree management.\n\n## IMPORTANT: Non-Interactive Mode Required\n\n**Always use explicit arguments. Interactive mode does not work in automated environments.**\n\n```bash\n# CORRECT - explicit arguments\nwm add feature-auth\nwm remove feature-auth\n\n# WRONG - interactive mode (will hang)\nwm add      # NO!\nwm remove   # NO!\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Command | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `wm init` | Initialize project config (.wm.yaml) |\n| `wm add <branch>` | Create worktree for branch |\n| `wm add <branch> -p <path>` | Create worktree at custom path |\n| `wm list` | List all worktrees |\n| `wm remove <branch>` | Remove worktree by branch name |\n| `wm remove <path>` | Remove worktree by path |\n| `wm remove -b <branch>` | Remove worktree AND delete branch |\n| `wm remove -f <branch>` | Force remove (skip confirmation) |\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Create Worktree\n\n```bash\n# Basic usage\nwm add feature-login\n\n# With custom path\nwm add feature-login -p ./workspaces/login\n\n# Branch with slash becomes hyphenated folder\nwm add feature/auth\n# Creates: ../wm_repo/feature-auth/\n```\n\n### Remove Worktree\n\n```bash\n# By branch name\nwm remove feature-auth\n\n# By path\nwm remove ../wm_repo/feature-auth\n\n# Also delete the git branch\nwm remove -b feature-auth\n\n# Force (skip confirmation)\nwm remove -f feature-auth\n```\n\n### List Worktrees\n\n```bash\nwm list\n# or\nwm ls\n```\n\n## Configuration (.wm.yaml)\n\n```yaml\nversion: 1\n\nworktree:\n  base_dir: \"../wm_{repo}\"  # {repo} replaced with repo name\n\nsync:\n  - \".env\"                  # Copy to worktree\n  - \"apps/*/.env\"           # Glob supported\n  - src: \".env.example\"\n    dst: \".env\"\n    mode: copy              # or \"symlink\"\n    when: missing           # or \"always\"\n\ntasks:\n  post_install:\n    mode: background        # Async execution\n    commands:\n      - \"npm install\"\n```\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Working on multiple features in parallel\n- Reviewing PRs while continuing other work\n- Running long builds/tests on separate branch\n- Quick branch switching without stash\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Solution |\n|---------|----------|\n| Using interactive mode | Always provide branch/path argument |\n| Expecting nested folders for `feature/auth` | Creates `feature-auth` (flat) since v0.1.1 |\n| Trying to remove main worktree | Not allowed - main worktree is protected |\n| Branch used by another worktree | Warning shown, requires confirmation |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:21.460Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing efficient git worktree management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高效的git工作树管理功能的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが効率的なgitのワークツリーマネージメント機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"개발 에이전트가 효율적인 git 작업 트리 관리 기능을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan capacidades de gestión de git worktree eficientes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de capacités de gestion de git worktree efficaces.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine effiziente git worktree-Verwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de capacidades de gerenciamento de worktree do git eficientes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуются эффективные возможности управления git worktree.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات إدارة شجرة العمل git الفعالة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage multiple worktrees efficiently using explicit CLI arguments, supporting non-interactive mode and project config initialization via .wm.yaml files.","zh":"赋予代理高效管理多个工作树的能力，使用显式的CLI参数，支持非交互模式，并通过.wm.yaml文件初始化项目配置。","ja":"エージェントに複数のワークツリーを効率的に管理する能力を付与し、明示的なCLI引数を使用して非対話モードをサポートし、.wm.yamlファイルを介してプロジェクト構成を初期化します。","ko":"에이전트가 명시적인 CLI 인수를 사용하여 다중 작업 트리를 효율적으로 관리할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 비대화 모드를 지원하고 .wm.yaml 파일을 통해 프로젝트 구성 초기화를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar múltiples worktrees de forma eficiente utilizando argumentos CLI explícitos, admitiendo el modo no interactivo y la inicialización de configuración de proyecto a través de archivos .wm.yaml.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer plusieurs worktrees de manière efficace en utilisant des arguments CLI explicites, en prenant en charge le mode non interactif et l''initialisation de la configuration de projet via des fichiers .wm.yaml.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, mehrere worktrees effizient zu verwalten, indem explizite CLI-Argumente verwendet werden, wodurch der nicht interaktive Modus und die Initialisierung der Projekt-Konfiguration über .wm.yaml-Dateien unterstützt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar várias worktrees de forma eficiente usando argumentos CLI explícitos, suportando modo não interativo e inicialização de configuração de projeto via arquivos .wm.yaml.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять несколькими worktree с помощью явных аргументов CLI, поддерживая неинтерактивный режим и инициализацию конфигурации проекта через файлы .wm.yaml.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة شجيرات العمل المتعددة بفعالية باستخدام حجة CLI صريحة ، ودعم الوضع غير التفاعلي ومبادرة cấu hình المشروع عبر ملفات .wm.yaml."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing project configurations with wm init","Adding new worktrees with wm add","Removing existing worktrees with wm remove"],"zh":["使用wm init初始化项目配置","使用wm add添加新工作树","使用wm remove删除现有工作树"],"ja":["wm initを使用してプロジェクト構成を初期化する","wm addを使用して新しいワークツリーを追加する","wm removeを使用して既存のワークツリーを削除する"],"ko":["wm init를 사용하여 프로젝트 구성 초기화","wm add를 사용하여 새로운 작업 트리 추가","wm remove를 사용하여 기존 작업 트리 제거"],"es":["Inicializar configuraciones de proyecto con wm init","Agregar nuevos worktrees con wm add","Eliminar worktrees existentes con wm remove"],"fr":["Initialiser les configurations de projet avec wm init","Ajouter de nouveaux worktrees avec wm add","Supprimer les worktrees existants avec wm remove"],"de":["Projektkonfigurationen mit wm init initialisieren","Neue worktrees mit wm add hinzufügen","Vorhandene worktrees mit wm remove entfernen"],"pt":["Inicializar configurações de projeto com wm init","Adicionar novas worktrees com wm add","Remover worktrees existentes com wm remove"],"ru":["Инициализировать конфигурацию проекта с помощью wm init","Добавить новые worktree с помощью wm add","Удалить существующие worktree с помощью wm remove"],"ar":["مبادرة cấu hình المشروع مع wm init","إضافة شجيرات العمل الجديدة مع wm add","إزالة شجيرات العمل الحالية مع wm remove"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires non-interactive mode","Explicit arguments mandatory","Limited to git worktree management"],"zh":["需要非交互模式","显式参数是必需的","仅限git工作树管理"],"ja":["非対話モードが必要","明示的な引数が必須","gitワークツリーマネージメントのみ"],"ko":["비대화 모드 필요","명시적인 인수가 필수","git 작업 트리 관리만 해당"],"es":["Requiere modo no interactivo","Argumentos explícitos obligatorios","Limitado a la gestión de git worktree"],"fr":["Nécessite le mode non interactif","Arguments explicites obligatoires","Limité à la gestion de git worktree"],"de":["Benötigt nicht interaktiven Modus","Explizite Argumente sind obligatorisch","Begrenzt auf die Verwaltung von git worktree"],"pt":["Exige modo não interativo","Argumentos explícitos são obrigatórios","Limitado ao gerenciamento de worktree do git"],"ru":["Требует неинтерактивного режима","Явные аргументы обязательны","Ограничен управлением worktree git"],"ar":["يتطلب الوضع غير التفاعلي","الحجج الصريحة مطلوبة","محدود لإدارة شجيرة العمل git"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"dee02150307cabe4ea14ced59b90284e6d5ba09c3e4927b25c8f3d9984de6370","qualityScore":51}');
