스템을 초기화 및 관리하는 데 도움을 주는 문서 작업 흐름 가이드를 제공하는 도구입니다","es":"El doc-workflow es un skill que proporciona orientación sobre el sistema de documentación llmdoc y sus flujos de trabajo","fr":"Le doc-workflow est un skill qui fournit des conseils sur le système de documentation llmdoc et ses flux de travail","de":"Der doc-workflow ist ein Skill, der Anleitungen zum Dokumentationssystem llmdoc und seinen Workflows bietet","pt":"O doc-workflow é uma habilidade de agente de IA que auxilia na configuração e gerenciamento de documentação de projetos","ru":"ИИ Агент doc-workflow - это агент, который помогает в настройке и управлении документацией проектов","ar":"الوكيل الذكي doc-workflow هو وكيل ذكي يساعد في إعداد وادارة توثيق المشاريع"},"features":{"en":["Provides llmdoc status via `test -d llmdoc` command","Supports documentation count using `find llmdoc -name ''*.md''`","Offers doc index preview through `cat llmdoc/index.md`","Recommends running `/tr:initDoc` for initialization","Guides workflow based on llmdoc initialization status","Utilizes Markdown file format for documentation"],"zh":["支持 llmdoc 文档系统初始化","提供文档工作流指南","支持文档数量统计","支持文档索引管理","集成 CLI 命令","支持多种文档格式"],"ja":["llmdoc ドキュメントシステムの初期化をサポート","ドキュメントワークフローガイダンスを提供","ドキュメント数の統計をサポート","ドキュメントインデックス管理をサポート","CLI コマンドを統合","複数のドキュメント形式をサポート"],"ko":["llmdoc 문서 시스템 초기화를 지원","문서 작업 흐름 가이드를 제공","문서 수 통계를 지원","문서 인덱스 관리를 지원","CLI 명령어를 통합","다양한 문서 형식을 지원"],"es":["Compatibilidad con el sistema de documentación llmdoc","Incorporación de comandos para inicializar y gestionar la documentación","Capacidad para ejecutar comandos como `/tr:initDoc` para inicializar el sistema de documentación","Compatibilidad con la indexación de documentos con `find` y `wc`","Visualización de los primeros 30 caracteres del índice de documentación con `head`"],"fr":["Compatibilité avec le système de documentation llmdoc","Intégration de commandes pour initialiser et gérer la documentation","Capacité à exécuter des commandes comme `/tr:initDoc` pour initialiser le système de documentation","Compatibilité avec l''indexation de documents avec `find` et `wc`","Visualisation des 30 premiers caractères de l''index de documentation avec `head`"],"de":["Kompatibilität mit dem Dokumentationssystem llmdoc","Integration von Befehlen zur Initialisierung und Verwaltung der Dokumentation","Fähigkeit, Befehle wie `/tr:initDoc` zur Initialisierung des Dokumentationssystems auszuführen","Kompatibilität mit der Indexierung von Dokumenten mit `find` und `wc`","Anzeige der ersten 30 Zeichen des Dokumentationsindex mit `head`"],"pt":["Suporte ao sistema de documentação llmdoc","Fluxos de trabalho de documentação personalizados","Inicialização do sistema de documentação com /tr:initDoc","Contagem de documentos com find llmdoc -name *.md","Índice de documentos com cat llmdoc/index.md"],"ru":["Поддержка системы документации llmdoc","Настраиваемые рабочие процессы документации","Инициализация системы документации с /tr:initDoc","Подсчет документов с find llmdoc -name *.md","Индекс документов с cat llmdoc/index.md"],"ar":["دعم نظام توثيق llmdoc","عمليات تدفق وثائق مخصصة","التشغيل الأول لنظام التوثيق مع /tr:initDoc","عد الوثائق مع find llmdoc -name *.md","فهرس الوثائق مع cat llmdoc/index.md"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use doc-workflow","what is doc-workflow","doc-workflow alternative","doc-workflow vs llmdoc","doc-workflow install guide","doc-workflow setup tutorial","llmdoc documentation system","markdown documentation workflow","doc-workflow for AI agents","doc-workflow initialization"],"zh":["doc-workflow","llmdoc","文档工作流","文档管理","CLI","文档系统","开发者工具","AI工具","文档格式"],"ja":["doc-workflow","llmdoc","ドキュメントワークフロー","ドキュメント管理","CLI","ドキュメントシステム","開発者ツール","AIエージェント","ドキュメント形式"],"ko":["doc-workflow","llmdoc","문서 작업 흐름","문서 관리","CLI","문서 시스템","개발자 도구","AI 도구","문서 형식"],"es":["doc-workflow","llmdoc","sistema de documentación","flujos de trabajo de documentación","inicializar documentación","Herramientas de documentación","Agentes de IA para documentación","Guías de configuración de doc-workflow"],"fr":["doc-workflow","llmdoc","système de documentation","flux de travail de documentation","initialiser la documentation","Outils de documentation","Agents IA pour la documentation","Guides de configuration de doc-workflow"],"de":["doc-workflow","llmdoc","Dokumentationssystem","Dokumentationsworkflows","Dokumentation initialisieren","Dokumentationswerkzeuge","KI-Agents für Dokumentation","Einrichtungsanleitungen für doc-workflow"],"pt":["doc-workflow","llmdoc","fluxo de trabalho de documentação","configuração de documentação","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de documentação","sistema de documentação","gerenciamento de documentação"],"ru":["ИИ Агент doc-workflow","llmdoc","рабочий процесс документации","настройка документации","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты документации","система документации","управление документацией"],"ar":["الوكيل الذكي doc-workflow","llmdoc","عملية تدفق الوثائق","إعداد التوثيق","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التوثيق","نظام التوثيق","إدارة التوثيق"]}},"owner":"TokenRollAI","repo":"cc-plugin","repoPath":"TokenRollAI/cc-plugin","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.276Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"doc-workflow","description":"Use when user asks about documentation workflow, how to document, doc system, what is llmdoc, how does llmdoc work, or needs guidance on the documentation system.","bodyPreview":"# /doc-workflow\n\nThis skill provides guidance on the llmdoc documentation system and available documentation workflows.\n\n## Pre-fetched Context\n\n- **Llmdoc status:** !`test -d llmdoc && echo \"INITIALIZED\" || echo \"NOT_INITIALIZED\"`\n- **Doc count:** !`find llmdoc -name \"*.md\" 2>/dev/null | wc -l`\n- **Doc index:** !`cat llmdoc/index.md 2>/dev/null | head -30`\n\n## Workflow Guide\n\n### If llmdoc is NOT initialized:\n\nRecommend running `/tr:initDoc` to initialize the documentation system.\n\nExplain the","body":"# /doc-workflow\n\nThis skill provides guidance on the llmdoc documentation system and available documentation workflows.\n\n## Pre-fetched Context\n\n- **Llmdoc status:** !`test -d llmdoc && echo \"INITIALIZED\" || echo \"NOT_INITIALIZED\"`\n- **Doc count:** !`find llmdoc -name \"*.md\" 2>/dev/null | wc -l`\n- **Doc index:** !`cat llmdoc/index.md 2>/dev/null | head -30`\n\n## Workflow Guide\n\n### If llmdoc is NOT initialized:\n\nRecommend running `/tr:initDoc` to initialize the documentation system.\n\nExplain the benefits:\n- Documentation-driven development\n- LLM-optimized retrieval maps\n- Consistent project understanding\n\n### If llmdoc IS initialized:\n\nExplain the available workflows:\n\n| Task | Command/Skill | Description |\n|------|--------------|-------------|\n| Read docs | `/read-doc` | Quick project understanding |\n| Update docs | `/update-doc` | Sync docs after code changes |\n| Investigate | `/investigate` | Doc-first codebase research |\n| Initialize | `/tr:initDoc` | One-time setup (already done) |\n\n### llmdoc Structure\n\n```\nllmdoc/\n├── index.md          # Navigation hub\n├── overview/         # \"What is this project?\"\n├── architecture/     # \"How does it work?\" (LLM Retrieval Map)\n├── guides/           # \"How do I do X?\"\n└── reference/        # \"What are the specifics?\"\n```\n\n## Actions\n\n1. Check the pre-fetched context to determine llmdoc status.\n2. Based on user''s question, provide relevant guidance.\n3. If user wants to perform an action, guide them to the appropriate skill/command.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:41.270Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents needing comprehensive documentation workflow management with llmdoc.","zh":"非常适合需要使用 llmdoc 进行全面文档工作流管理的 Developer Agents","ja":"llmdoc を使用した包括的なドキュメント ワークフロー管理が必要な Developer Agents に最適","ko":"llmdoc를 사용하여 종합적인 문서 작업 흐름 관리가 필요한 Developer Agents 에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que necesitan una gestión de flujo de documentación integral con llmdoc.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement qui ont besoin d''une gestion complète du flux de documentation avec llmdoc.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsagenten, die eine umfassende Dokumentations-Workflow-Verwaltung mit llmdoc benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que necessitam de gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho de documentação abrangente com llmdoc.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-разработчиков, которым требуется комплексное управление документацией с помощью llmdoc.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة تدفق العمل الوثائقي الشامل مع llmdoc."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage documentation systems using llmdoc, providing initialization support and workflow guidance, including Markdown file management and documentation indexing.","zh":"赋予代理管理使用 llmdoc 的文档系统的能力，提供初始化支持和工作流指南，包括 Markdown 文件管理和文档索引","ja":"llmdoc を使用したドキュメント システムの管理をエージェントに可能にし、初期化サポートとワークフロー ガイダンスを提供し、Markdown ファイル管理とドキュメント インデックスを含む","ko":"에이전트가 llmdoc를 사용하여 문서 시스템을 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 초기화 지원 및 워크플로우 가이드를 제공하며, Markdown 파일 관리 및 문서 색인 등을 포함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar sistemas de documentación utilizando llmdoc, brindando soporte de inicialización y orientación del flujo de trabajo, incluyendo la gestión de archivos Markdown y la indexación de documentación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des systèmes de documentation en utilisant llmdoc, en fournissant un support d''initialisation et une orientation du flux de travail, y compris la gestion de fichiers Markdown et l''indexation de la documentation.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Dokumentationssysteme mithilfe von llmdoc zu verwalten, indem sie Initialisierungsunterstützung und Workflow-Anleitung bieten, einschließlich der Verwaltung von Markdown-Dateien und der Dokumentationsindizierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar sistemas de documentação usando llmdoc, fornecendo suporte de inicialização e orientação de fluxo de trabalho, incluindo gerenciamento de arquivos Markdown e indexação de documentação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять документацией с помощью llmdoc, обеспечивая поддержку инициализации и руководство по рабочему процессу, включая управление файлами Markdown и индексацию документации.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة أنظمة الوثائق باستخدام llmdoc، مع تقديم دعم للت.initialization و إرشادات لتدفق العمل، بما في ذلك إدارة ملفات Markdown وفهرسة الوثائق."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing documentation systems with /tr:initDoc","Managing Markdown files within the llmdoc directory","Debugging documentation workflows using llmdoc status and doc count"],"zh":["使用 /tr:initDoc 初始化文档系统","在 llmdoc 目录中管理 Markdown 文件","使用 llmdoc 状态和文档计数进行文档工作流调试"],"ja":["ドキュメント システムの初期化に /tr:initDoc を使用","llmdoc ディレクトリ内で Markdown ファイルを管理","llmdoc の状態とドキュメント カウントを使用してドキュメント ワークフローをデバッグ"],"ko":["/tr:initDoc를 사용하여 문서 시스템 초기화","llmdoc 디렉토리 내에서 Markdown 파일 관리","llmdoc 상태 및 문서 수를 사용하여 문서 작업 흐름 디버깅"],"es":["Inicializar sistemas de documentación con /tr:initDoc","Administrar archivos Markdown dentro del directorio llmdoc","Depurar flujos de trabajo de documentación utilizando llmdoc estado y recuento de documentos"],"fr":["Initialiser des systèmes de documentation avec /tr:initDoc","Gérer des fichiers Markdown dans le répertoire llmdoc","Déboguer les flux de travail de documentation en utilisant llmdoc état et comptage de documents"],"de":["Dokumentationssysteme mit /tr:initDoc initialisieren","Markdown-Dateien innerhalb des llmdoc-Verzeichnisses verwalten","Dokumentations-Workflows mithilfe von llmdoc-Zustand und Dokumentenanzahl debuggen"],"pt":["Inicializando sistemas de documentação com /tr:initDoc","Gerenciando arquivos Markdown dentro do diretório llmdoc","Depurando fluxos de trabalho de documentação usando llmdoc status e contagem de documentos"],"ru":["Инициализация систем документации с помощью /tr:initDoc","Управление файлами Markdown внутри директории llmdoc","Отладка потоков документации с помощью llmdoc status и счётчика документов"],"ar":["ت.initialization لأنظمة الوثائق مع /tr:initDoc","إدارة ملفات Markdown داخل دليل llmdoc","تصحيح أخطاء تدفقات العمل للوثائق باستخدام حالة llmdoc و عداد الوثائق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires llmdoc installation","Limited to Markdown file format","Initialization required before use"],"zh":["需要 llmdoc 安装","仅限 Markdown 文件格式","使用前需要初始化"],"ja":["llmdoc のインストールが必要","Markdown ファイル形式のみ","使用前に初期化が必要"],"ko":["llmdoc 설치 필요","Markdown 파일 형식만 해당","사용 전 초기화 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de llmdoc","Limitado al formato de archivo Markdown","Inicialización requerida antes del uso"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de llmdoc","Limité au format de fichier Markdown","Initialisation requise avant utilisation"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von llmdoc","Begrenzt auf das Markdown-Dateiformat","Initialisierung erforderlich vor der Verwendung"],"pt":["Requer instalação do llmdoc","Limitado ao formato de arquivo Markdown","Inicialização necessária antes do uso"],"ru":["Требуется установка llmdoc","Ограничен форматом файла Markdown","Инициализация обязательна перед использованием"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت llmdoc","محدود بتنسيق ملف Markdown","الت.initialization مطلوب قبل الاستخدام"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"41e695ca35ebc337eb25cf99acc53ccf49a513af31d705cdc0754ae3100da8c7","qualityScore":51}');
