INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('TokenRollAI/cc-plugin/doc-workflow', 'doc-workflow', 'TokenRollAI', 'cc-plugin', 'community', 'doc-workflow TokenRollAI cc-plugin community The doc-workflow skill provides guidance on the llmdoc documentation system, offering workflows and initialization support for developers. It benefits developers working with documentation systems. doc-workflow 提供了有关 llmdoc 文档系统和可用文档工作流的指导，帮助开发者高效管理文档 doc-workflow は、llmdoc ドキュメントシステムと利用可能なドキュメントワークフローに関するガイダンスを提供し、開発者がドキュメントを効率的に管理できるようにします doc-workflow는 llmdoc 문서 시스템 및 사용 가능한 문서 작업 흐름에 대한 지침을 제공하여 개발자가 문서를 효율적으로 관리할 수 있도록 합니다 El skill de doc-workflow proporciona orientación sobre el sistema de documentación llmdoc y los flujos de trabajo de documentación disponibles Le skill de doc-workflow fournit des conseils sur le système de documentation llmdoc et les flux de travail de documentation disponibles Der doc-workflow-Skill bietet Anleitungen zum Dokumentationssystem llmdoc und den verfügbaren Dokumentationsworkflows O doc-workflow é uma habilidade que fornece orientação sobre o sistema de documentação llmdoc e os fluxos de trabalho de documentação disponíveis. ИИ Агент doc-workflow предоставляет руководство по системе документации llmdoc и доступным рабочим процессам документации. الوكيل الذكي doc-workflow يقدم إرشادات حول نظام توثيق llmdoc والعمليات المتاحة لتدفق الوثائق how to use doc-workflow what is doc-workflow doc-workflow alternative doc-workflow vs llmdoc doc-workflow install guide doc-workflow setup tutorial llmdoc documentation system markdown documentation workflow doc-workflow for AI agents doc-workflow initialization doc-workflow llmdoc 文档工作流 文档管理 CLI 文档系统 开发者工具 AI工具 文档格式 Provides llmdoc status via `test -d llmdoc` command Supports documentation count using `find llmdoc -name ''*.md''` Offers doc index preview through `cat llmdoc/index.md` Recommends running `/tr:initDoc` for initialization Guides workflow based on llmdoc initialization status Utilizes Markdown file format for documentation doc-workflow is a skill that provides guidance on the llmdoc documentation system and available documentation workflows, supporting initialization and optimization.');
