متوازية بشكل فعال، مع зависимости المهام وتحديثات السجلات"},"definition":{"en":"parallel-task is a skill that enables AI agents to act as orchestrators for subagents, managing task dependencies and updating plan documents.","zh":"parallel-task是指一种能够并行执行多个任务的执行器","ja":"parallel-taskは、複数のタスクを並列に実行することができる実行器のこと","ko":"parallel-task는 여러 작업을 병렬로 실행할 수 있는 실행기의 역할을 하는 것","es":"Un ejecutor de tareas paralelas es un tipo de agente de inteligencia artificial que gestiona la ejecución de tareas en paralelo","fr":"Un exécuteur de tâches parallèles est un type d''outil d''intelligence artificielle qui gère l''exécution de tâches en parallèle","de":"Ein paralleler Aufgabenausführer ist eine Art von KI-Agent, der die Ausführung von Aufgaben parallel verwaltet","pt":"O que é parallel-task? É um executor de tarefas paralelas que orquestra subagentes para realizar tarefas de forma eficiente","ru":"Что такое параллельное выполнение задач? Это исполнитель параллельных задач, который оркестрирует субагентов для выполнения задач эффективно","ar":"ما هو parallel-task؟ هو منفذ مهام متوازية يorchestra وكلاء فرعيين للقيام بالمهام بفعالية"},"features":{"en":["Parses plan files to extract task dependencies","Delegates tasks to parallel subagents in waves","Ensures correct task completion order using orchestration mode","Updates plan documents with logs after each task completion","Utilizes a loop to manage tasks until all are completed"],"zh":["解析计划文件","委托任务给子代理","任务依赖关系管理","循环执行任务","日志更新"],"ja":["プランファイルの解析","タスクのサブエージェントへの委託","タスク依存関係の管理","ループ実行","ログ更新"],"ko":["계획 파일解析","작업을 하위 에이전트에 위임","작업 의존성 관리","루프 실행","로그 업데이트"],"es":["Ejecución de tareas en paralelo con subagentes","Delegación de tareas utilizando dependencias de tareas","Lanzamiento de subagentes en el orden correcto","Actualización de documentos de planificación con registros después de cada tarea","Uso de modo de orquestación para parsear archivos de planificación"],"fr":["Exécution de tâches en parallèle avec des sous-agents","Délégation de tâches en utilisant des dépendances de tâches","Lancement de sous-agents dans le bon ordre","Mise à jour de documents de planification avec des journaux après chaque tâche","Utilisation du mode d''orchestration pour parser des fichiers de planification"],"de":["Ausführung von Aufgaben parallel mit Subagenten","Delegierung von Aufgaben mithilfe von Aufgabenabhängigkeiten","Starten von Subagenten in der richtigen Reihenfolge","Aktualisierung von Planungsdokumenten mit Protokollen nach jeder Aufgabe","Verwendung des Orchestrierungsmodus zum Parsen von Planungsdateien"],"pt":["Execução de tarefas em paralelo com dependências de tarefas","Orquestração de subagentes para realizar tarefas de forma eficiente","Atualizações de logs após cada tarefa ser concluída","Suporte a planos de tarefas complexos","Integração com tecnologias de automação de tarefas","Suporte a execução de tarefas em loop até a conclusão"],"ru":["Параллельное выполнение задач с зависимостями задач","Оркестрация субагентов для выполнения задач эффективно","Обновления журналов после каждой задачи","Поддержка сложных планов задач","Интеграция с технологиями автоматизации задач","Поддержка выполнения задач в цикле до завершения"],"ar":["تنفيذ مهام متوازية مع зависимости المهام","أوركسترا وكلاء فرعيين للقيام بالمهام بفعالية","تحديثات السجلات بعد كل مهمة","دعم خطط المهام المعقدة","التكامل مع تكنولوجيا أتمتة المهام","دعم تنفيذ المهام في حلقة حتى الإكمال"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use parallel-task","parallel-task setup guide","what is parallel-task","parallel-task alternative","parallel-task vs workflow management","parallel-task install","parallel-task orchestration mode"],"zh":["parallel-task","AIエージェント","并行任务执行","计划文件解析","任务依赖关系","子代理管理","日志更新","Python","CLI"],"ja":["parallel-task","AIエージェント","並列タスク実行","プランファイル解析","タスク依存関係","サブエージェント管理","ログ更新","Python","CLI"],"ko":["parallel-task","AIツール","병렬 작업 실행","계획 파일解析","작업 의존성","하위 에이전트 관리","로그 업데이트","Python","CLI"],"es":["tareas paralelas","agentes de inteligencia artificial","subagentes","dependencias de tareas","modo de orquestación","parseo de archivos de planificación","actualización de documentos de planificación"],"fr":["tâches parallèles","outils d''intelligence artificielle","sous-agents","dépendances de tâches","mode d''orchestration","parse de fichiers de planification","mise à jour de documents de planification"],"de":["parallele Aufgaben","KI-Agents","Subagenten","Aufgabenabhängigkeiten","Orchestrierungsmodus","Parsen von Planungsdateien","Aktualisierung von Planungsdokumenten"],"pt":["parallel-task","executor de tarefas paralelas","orquestração de subagentes","dependências de tarefas","atualizações de logs","plano de tarefas","automação de tarefas","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software"],"ru":["параллельное выполнение задач","ИИ Агенты","исполнитель параллельных задач","оркестрация субагентов","зависимости задач","обновления журналов","план задач","автоматизация задач","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения"],"ar":["parallel-task","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","منفذ مهام متوازية","أوركسترا وكلاء فرعيين","اعتماديات المهام","تحديثات السجلات","خطة المهام","أتمتة المهام","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"am-will","repo":"codex-skills","repoPath":"am-will/codex-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.276Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"parallel-task","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Parallel Task Executor\n\nYou are an Orchestrator for subagents. Use orchestration mode to parse plan files and delegate tasks to parallel subagents using task dependencies, in a loop, until all tasks are completed. Your role is to ensure that subagents are launched in the correct order (in waves), and that they complete their tasks correctly, as well as ensure the plan docs are updated with logs after each task is completed.\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Parse Request\n\nExtract from user request:\n1.","body":"# Parallel Task Executor\n\nYou are an Orchestrator for subagents. Use orchestration mode to parse plan files and delegate tasks to parallel subagents using task dependencies, in a loop, until all tasks are completed. Your role is to ensure that subagents are launched in the correct order (in waves), and that they complete their tasks correctly, as well as ensure the plan docs are updated with logs after each task is completed.\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Parse Request\n\nExtract from user request:\n1. **Plan file**: The markdown plan to read\n2. **Task subset** (optional): Specific task IDs to run\n\nIf no subset provided, run the full plan.\n\n### Step 2: Read & Parse Plan\n\n1. Find task subsections (e.g., `### T1:` or `### Task 1.1:`)\n2. For each task, extract:\n   - Task ID and name\n   - **depends_on** list (from `- **depends_on**: [...]`)\n   - Full content (description, location, acceptance criteria, validation)\n3. Build task list\n4. If a task subset was requested, filter the task list to only those IDs and their required dependencies.\n\n### Step 3: Launch Subagents\n\nFor each **unblocked** task, launch subagent with:\n- **description**: \"Implement task [ID]: [name]\"\n- **prompt**: Use template below\n\nLaunch all unblocked tasks in parallel. A task is unblocked if all IDs in its depends_on list are complete.\n\n### Task Prompt Template\n\n```\nYou are implementing a specific task from a development plan.\n\n## Context\n- Plan: [filename]\n- Goals: [relevant overview from plan]\n- Dependencies: [prerequisites for this task]\n- Related tasks: [tasks that depend on or are depended on by this task]\n- Constraints: [risks from plan]\n\n## Your Task\n**Task [ID]: [Name]**\n\nLocation: [File paths]\nDescription: [Full description]\n\nAcceptance Criteria:\n[List from plan]\n\nValidation:\n[Tests or verification from plan]\n\n## Instructions\n1. Examine working plan and any relevant or dependent files\n2. Implement changes for all acceptance criteria\n3. Keep work **atomic and committable**\n4. For each file: read first, edit carefully, preserve formatting\n5. Run validation if feasible\n6. **ALWAYS mark completed tasks IN THE *-plan.md file AS SOON AS YOU COMPLETE IT!** and update with:\n    - Concise work log\n    - Files modified/created\n    - Errors or gotchas encountered\n7. Commit your work\n   - Note: There are other agents working in parallel to you, so only stage and commit the files you worked on. NEVER PUSH. ONLY COMMIT.\n8. Double Check that you updated the *-plan.md file and committed your work before yielding\n9. Return summary of:\n   - Files modified/created\n   - Changes made\n   - How criteria are satisfied\n   - Validation performed or deferred\n\n## Important\n- Be careful with paths\n- Stop and describe blockers if encountered\n- Focus on this specific task\n```\n\nEnsure that the agent marked its task complete before moving on to the next task or set of tasks.\n\n### Step 4: Check and Validate.\n\nAfter subagents complete their work:\n1. Inspect their outputs for correctness and completeness.\n2. Validate the results against the expected outcomes.\n3. If the task is truly completed correctly, ENSURE THAT TASK WAS MARKED COMPLETE WITH LOGS.\n4. If a task was not successful, have the agent retry or escalate the issue.\n5. Ensure that that wave of work has been committed to github before moving on to the next wave of tasks.\n\n### Step 5: Repeat\n\n1. Review the plan again to see what new set of unblocked tasks are available.\n2. Continue launching unblocked tasks in parallel until plan is done.\n3. Repeat the process until *all** tasks are both complete, validated, and working without errors. \n\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- Task subset not found: List available task IDs\n- Parse failure: Show what was tried, ask for clarification\n\n## Example Usage\n\n```\n''Implement the plan using parallel task skill''\n/parallel-task plan.md\n/parallel-task ./plans/auth-plan.md T1 T2 T4\n/parallel-task user-profile-plan.md --tasks T3 T7\n```\n\n## Execution Summary Template\n\n```markdown\n# Execution Summary\n\n## Tasks Assigned: [N]\n\n### Completed\n- Task [ID]: [Name] - [Brief summary]\n\n### Issues\n- Task [ID]: [Name]\n  - Issue: [What went wrong]\n  - Resolution: [How resolved or what''s needed]\n\n### Blocked\n- Task [ID]: [Name]\n  - Blocker: [What''s preventing completion]\n  - Next Steps: [What needs to happen]\n\n## Overall Status\n[Completion summary]\n\n## Files Modified\n[List of changed files]\n\n## Next Steps\n[Recommendations]\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:41.592Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents requiring efficient task management and parallel processing capabilities, such as Cursor, Windsurf, and AutoGPT.","zh":"适合需要高效任务管理和并行处理能力的AI代理，例如Cursor、Windsurf和AutoGPT。","ja":"タスク管理と並行処理能力が効率的なAIエージェントに適しています。例としては、Cursor、Windsurf、AutoGPTなどがあります。","ko":"효율적인 태스크 관리와 병렬 처리 능력이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 예를 들어, Cursor, Windsurf, AutoGPT와 같은 에이전트가 있습니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que requieren una gestión de tareas eficiente y capacidades de procesamiento paralelo, como Cursor, Windsurf y AutoGPT.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA nécessitant une gestion de tâches efficace et des capacités de traitement parallèle, tels que Cursor, Windsurf et AutoGPT.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die eine effiziente Aufgabenverwaltung und parallele Verarbeitungsfähigkeiten erfordern, wie z. B. Cursor, Windsurf und AutoGPT.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA que exigem gerenciamento de tarefas eficiente e capacidades de processamento paralelo, como Cursor, Windsurf e AutoGPT.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, требующих эффективного управления задачами и возможностей параллельной обработки, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и AutoGPT.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكلاء الذكية التي تتطلب إدارة مهمات فعالة وقدرات معالجة متوازية، مثل Cursor و Windsurf و AutoGPT."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to orchestrate subagents, parse plan files, and delegate tasks in a loop until completion, utilizing task dependencies and ensuring correct task ordering, all while updating plan documents with logs after each task completion, leveraging orchestration mode and parallel subagents.","zh":"赋予代理orchestration模式，解析计划文件，并委托任务到子代理，利用任务依赖关系，确保正确的任务顺序，并在每个任务完成后更新计划文档的日志，利用orchestration模式和并行子代理。","ja":"エージェントにオーケストレーション モードを実行させ、プラン ファイルを解析し、サブエージェントにタスクを委託し、タスクの依存関係を利用して正しいタスクの順序を保証し、各タスクの完了後にプラン ドキュメントのログを更新することを可能にし、オーケストレーション モードと並行サブエージェントを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 오케스트레이션 모드를 사용하여 서브 에이전트들에게 태스크를 위임하고, 태스크 종속성을 사용하여 올바른 태스크 순서를 보장하고, 각 태스크가 완료된 후 계획 문서의 로그를 업데이트하며, 오케스트레이션 모드와 병렬 서브 에이전트를 사용하도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a orquestar subagentes, analizar archivos de planificación, delegar tareas en un bucle hasta la finalización, utilizando dependencias de tareas y asegurando el correcto orden de tareas, todo mientras actualiza los documentos de planificación con registros después de cada finalización de tarea, aprovechando el modo de orquestación y subagentes paralelos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''orchestrer des sous-agents, d''analyser des fichiers de planification, de déléguer des tâches dans une boucle jusqu''à l''achèvement, en utilisant les dépendances de tâches et en garantissant l''ordre correct des tâches, le tout en mettant à jour les documents de planification avec des journaux après chaque achèvement de tâche, en exploitant le mode d''orchestration et les sous-agents parallèles.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Subagents zu orchestrieren, Planungsdateien zu parsen, Aufgaben in einer Schleife bis zur Fertigstellung zu delegieren, wobei Aufgabenabhängigkeiten genutzt und die korrekte Aufgabenreihenfolge sichergestellt wird, während die Planungsunterlagen mit Protokollen nach jeder Aufgabenfertigstellung aktualisiert werden, wobei der Orchestrierungsmodus und parallele Subagents genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a orquestrar subagentes, analisar arquivos de plano, delegar tarefas em um loop até a conclusão, utilizando dependências de tarefas e garantindo a ordem correta das tarefas, tudo isso atualizando documentos de plano com logs após cada conclusão de tarefa, aproveitando o modo de orquestração e subagentes paralelos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оркестрировать субагентов, парсить файлы планов, делегировать задачи в цикле до завершения, используя зависимости задач и обеспечивая правильный порядок задач, все это обновляя документы плана журналами после каждого завершения задачи, используя режим оркестровки и параллельных субагентов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنسيق عمليات الوكلاء الفرعية، وتحليل ملفات الخطة، وتفويض المهام في حلقة حتى الاستكمال، مع استخدام зависимости المهام وضمان الترتيب الصحيح للمهام، مع تحديث مستندات الخطة بالسجلات بعد كل استكمال لمهمة، واستغلال وضع التنسيق والوكلاء الفرعية المتوازية."},"useCases":{"en":["Orchestrating multiple subagents to execute tasks concurrently","Parsing complex plan files to delegate tasks efficiently","Updating plan documents with logs after each task completion for transparency and auditing"],"zh":["同时执行多个子代理的任务","解析复杂的计划文件以高效地委托任务","在每个任务完成后更新计划文档的日志以实现透明度和审计"],"ja":["複数のサブエージェントを同時に実行してタスクを実行する","複雑なプラン ファイルを解析してタスクを効率的に委託する","各タスクの完了後にプラン ドキュメントのログを更新して透明性と監査を実現する"],"ko":["서브 에이전트 여러 개의 태스크를 동시에 실행하는 것","복잡한 계획 파일을 분석하여 태스크를 효율적으로 위임하는 것","각 태스크가 완료된 후 계획 문서의 로그를 업데이트하여 투명성과 감사를 실현하는 것"],"es":["Orquestar varios subagentes para ejecutar tareas de forma concurrente","Analizar archivos de planificación complejos para delegar tareas de forma eficiente","Actualizar documentos de planificación con registros después de cada finalización de tarea para garantizar la transparencia y la auditoría"],"fr":["Orchestrer plusieurs sous-agents pour exécuter des tâches de manière concurrente","Analyser des fichiers de planification complexes pour déléguer des tâches de manière efficace","Mettre à jour les documents de planification avec des journaux après chaque achèvement de tâche pour assurer la transparence et l''audit"],"de":["Mehrere Subagents orchestrieren, um Aufgaben gleichzeitig auszuführen","Komplexe Planungsdateien analysieren, um Aufgaben effizient zu delegieren","Planungsunterlagen mit Protokollen nach jeder Aufgabenfertigstellung aktualisieren, um Transparenz und Auditing zu gewährleisten"],"pt":["Orquestrando vários subagentes para executar tarefas concorrentemente","Analisando arquivos de plano complexos para delegar tarefas de forma eficiente","Atualizando documentos de plano com logs após cada conclusão de tarefa para transparência e auditoria"],"ru":["Оркестрирование нескольких субагентов для выполнения задач параллельно","Парсинг сложных файлов планов для делегирования задач эффективно","Обновление документов плана журналами после каждого завершения задачи для прозрачности и аудита"],"ar":["تنسيق العديد من الوكلاء الفرعية لتنفيذ المهام بشكل متوازي","تحليل ملفات الخطة المعقدة لتفويض المهام بفعالية","تحديث مستندات الخطة بالسجلات بعد كل استكمال لمهمة من أجل الشفافية والتدقيق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires orchestration mode to be enabled","Dependent on correct task dependencies for proper execution","Limited to agents capable of parsing plan files and delegating tasks to subagents"],"zh":["需要启用orchestration模式","依赖于正确的任务依赖关系以确保正确的执行","仅限于能够解析计划文件和委托任务到子代理的代理"],"ja":["オーケストレーション モードを有効にする必要がある","正しいタスクの依存関係に依存して正しい実行を保証する","プラン ファイルを解析し、タスクをサブエージェントに委託できるエージェントにのみ限定される"],"ko":["오케스트레이션 모드를 활성화해야 하는 것","올바른 태스크 종속성을 사용하여 올바른 실행을 보장하는 것","계획 파일을 분석하고 태스크를 서브 에이전트에게 위임할 수 있는 에이전트로만 제한되는 것"],"es":["Requiere que el modo de orquestación esté habilitado","Depende de las dependencias de tareas correctas para una ejecución adecuada","Limitado a agents capaces de analizar archivos de planificación y delegar tareas a subagentes"],"fr":["Nécessite que le mode d''orchestration soit activé","Dépend des dépendances de tâches correctes pour une exécution appropriée","Limité aux agents capables d''analyser des fichiers de planification et de déléguer des tâches à des sous-agents"],"de":["Benötigt den aktivierten Orchestrierungsmodus","Hängt von den korrekten Aufgabenabhängigkeiten für eine ordnungsgemäße Ausführung ab","Begrenzt auf Agents, die in der Lage sind, Planungsdateien zu parsen und Aufgaben an Subagents zu delegieren"],"pt":["Exige que o modo de orquestração esteja habilitado","Depende das dependências de tarefas corretas para execução adequada","Limitado a agentes capazes de analisar arquivos de plano e delegar tarefas a subagentes"],"ru":["Требует включения режима оркестровки","Зависит от правильных зависимостей задач для правильного выполнения","Ограничен агентами, способными парсить файлы планов и делегировать задачи субагентам"],"ar":["يتطلب تفعيل وضع التنسيق","يعتمد على зависимости المهام الصحيحة للتنفيذ الصحيح","محدود بالوكلاء القادرين على تحليل ملفات الخطة وتفويض المهام إلى الوكلاء الفرعية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"845989617d00f5a2c40be92ceee34604d310ce877b1a530056b298a155e53f72","qualityScore":51}');
