skill that correlates SIEM alerts with Indicators of Compromise (IOCs) to identify potential security threats","zh":"correlate-ioc 是一种检查现有的 SIEM 警报和案例的 Skill，使用 IOC_LIST 和可选参数","ja":"correlate-ioc は、既存の SIEM アラートとケースを関連付ける Skill で、IOC_LIST およびオプション パラメータを使用する","ko":"correlate-ioc는 기존 SIEM 경고와 사례를 확인하는 스킬로, IOC_LIST 및 선택적 매개 변수를 사용","es":"Correlate-ioc es una habilidad que busca alertas de SIEM y casos relacionados con Indicadores de Compromiso","fr":"Correlate-ioc est une compétence qui recherche des alertas SIEM et des cas liés aux indicateurs de compromis","de":"Correlate-ioc ist eine Fähigkeit, die SIEM-Alarme und Fälle in Bezug auf Kompromissindikatoren sucht","pt":"O Correlate-IOC é uma ferramenta de análise de Indicadores de Comprometimento que correlaciona alerts de SIEM e casos de SOAR para detectar ameaças","ru":"ИИ Агент Correlate-IOC - это инструмент анализа Индикаторов Компрометации, который коррелирует оповещения SIEM и дела SOAR для обнаружения угроз","ar":"أداة تجميع IOC هي أداة تحليل مؤشرات الاختراق التي تجميع تنبيهات SIEM وحالات SOAR لاكتشاف التهديدات"},"features":{"en":["Searches for alerts containing any IOC in the list using SIEM alert data","Supports optional lookback period for SIEM alerts via TIME_FRAME_HOURS parameter","Allows additional filtering for SOAR cases using SOAR_CASE_FILTER parameter","Correlates IOCs such as IP addresses (e.g., 198.51.100.10) and domains (e.g., evil-domain.com)"],"zh":["支持 IOC_LIST 和 TIME_FRAME_HOURS 参数","可选的 SOAR_CASE_FILTER 参数","与 SIEM 警报和案例集成","使用 Python 进行开发","支持 CLI 命令"],"ja":["IOC_LIST と TIME_FRAME_HOURS パラメータをサポート","オプションの SOAR_CASE_FILTER パラメータ","SIEM アラートとケースとの統合","Python を使用した開発","CLI コマンドのサポート"],"ko":["IOC_LIST 및 TIME_FRAME_HOURS 매개 변수 지원","선택적 SOAR_CASE_FILTER 매개 변수","SIEM 경고 및 사례와의 통합","Python을 사용한 개발","CLI 명령어 지원"],"es":["Búsqueda de alertas de SIEM que contienen Indicadores de Compromiso","Configuración de período de búsqueda personalizable (TIME_FRAME_HOURS)","Filtrado adicional de casos de SOAR (SOAR_CASE_FILTER)","Compatibilidad con listas de IOCs","Integración con agentes de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["Recherche d''alertes SIEM contenant des indicateurs de compromis","Configuration de la période de recherche personnalisable (TIME_FRAME_HOURS)","Filtrage supplémentaire des cas de SOAR (SOAR_CASE_FILTER)","Compatibilité avec des listes d''IOCs","Intégration avec les agents d''IA"],"de":["Suche nach SIEM-Alarmen, die Kompromissindikatoren enthalten","Konfiguration des anpassbaren Suchzeitraums (TIME_FRAME_HOURS)","Zusätzliche Filterung von SOAR-Fällen (SOAR_CASE_FILTER)","Kompatibilität mit IOC-Listen","Integration mit KI-Agents"],"pt":["Análise de Indicadores de Comprometimento","Busca de alerts de SIEM","Integração com casos de SOAR","Filtro de tempo para alerts de SIEM","Filtro adicional para casos de SOAR"],"ru":["Анализ Индикаторов Компрометации","Поиск оповещений SIEM","Интеграция с делами SOAR","Фильтр времени для оповещений SIEM","Дополнительный фильтр для дел SOAR"],"ar":["تحليل مؤشرات الاختراق","بحث عن تنبيهات SIEM","تكامل مع حالات SOAR","مرشح زمني لتنبيهات SIEM","مرشح إضافي لحالات SOAR"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use correlate-ioc","correlate-ioc setup guide","SIEM alert correlation","Indicators of Compromise (IOCs) analysis","correlate-ioc vs other security tools","install correlate-ioc","what is correlate-ioc","correlate-ioc tutorial","correlate-ioc best practices"],"zh":["correlate-ioc","SIEM 警报","案例关联","IOC_LIST","TIME_FRAME_HOURS","SOAR_CASE_FILTER","Python 开发","CLI 命令"],"ja":["correlate-ioc","SIEM アラート","ケース関連付け","IOC_LIST","TIME_FRAME_HOURS","SOAR_CASE_FILTER","Python 開発","CLI コマンド"],"ko":["correlate-ioc","SIEM 경고","사례 연관","IOC_LIST","TIME_FRAME_HOURS","SOAR_CASE_FILTER","Python 개발","CLI 명령어"],"es":["correlate-ioc","agentes de inteligencia artificial","Indicadores de Compromiso","SIEM","SOAR","IOCs","seguridad informática","análisis de amenazas","configuración de habilidades"],"fr":["correlate-ioc","agents d''IA","indicateurs de compromis","SIEM","SOAR","IOCs","sécurité informatique","analyse de menaces","configuration de compétences"],"de":["correlate-ioc","KI-Agents","Kompromissindikatoren","SIEM","SOAR","IOCs","IT-Sicherheit","Bedrohungsanalyse","Konfiguration von Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["Correlate-IOC","análise de Indicadores de Comprometimento","SIEM","SOAR","segurança cibernética","detecção de ameaças","ferramentas de análise de segurança"],"ru":["ИИ Агент Correlate-IOC","анализ Индикаторов Компрометации","SIEM","SOAR","кибербезопасность","обнаружение угроз","инструменты анализа безопасности"],"ar":["أداة تجميع IOC","تحليل مؤشرات الاختراق","SIEM","SOAR","أمن المعلومات","اكتشاف التهديدات","أدوات تحليل الأمن"]}},"owner":"dandye","repo":"ai-runbooks","repoPath":"dandye/ai-runbooks","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.285Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"correlate-ioc","description":"Check for existing SIEM alerts and case management entries related to IOCs. Use to understand if an indicator has triggered previous alerts or is part of ongoing investigations. Takes IOC list and returns related alerts and cases.","bodyPreview":"# Correlate IOC Skill\n\nCheck for existing SIEM alerts and cases related to specific Indicators of Compromise.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `IOC_LIST` - Single IOC or list of IOCs (e.g., `[\"198.51.100.10\", \"evil-domain.com\"]`)\n- *(Optional)* `TIME_FRAME_HOURS` - Lookback period for SIEM alerts (default: 168 = 7 days)\n- *(Optional)* `SOAR_CASE_FILTER` - Additional filter for SOAR cases (e.g., `status=\"OPEN\"`)\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Correlate SIEM Alerts\n\nSearch for alerts containing any IOC in the list:\n\n```","body":"# Correlate IOC Skill\n\nCheck for existing SIEM alerts and cases related to specific Indicators of Compromise.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `IOC_LIST` - Single IOC or list of IOCs (e.g., `[\"198.51.100.10\", \"evil-domain.com\"]`)\n- *(Optional)* `TIME_FRAME_HOURS` - Lookback period for SIEM alerts (default: 168 = 7 days)\n- *(Optional)* `SOAR_CASE_FILTER` - Additional filter for SOAR cases (e.g., `status=\"OPEN\"`)\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Correlate SIEM Alerts\n\nSearch for alerts containing any IOC in the list:\n\n```\nsecops-mcp.get_security_alerts(\n    query=IOC_based_query,\n    hours_back=TIME_FRAME_HOURS\n)\n```\n\nStore summary in `RELATED_SIEM_ALERTS`:\n- Alert count\n- Alert types/names\n- Severity distribution\n- Affected assets\n\n### Step 2: Correlate Cases\n\nSearch for cases containing any IOC:\n\n```\nsecops-soar.list_cases(\n    filter=IOC_based_filter + SOAR_CASE_FILTER\n)\n```\n\nStore summary in `RELATED_SOAR_CASES`:\n- Case IDs and names\n- Case status\n- Case priority\n\n## Required Outputs\n\n**After completing this skill, you MUST report these outputs:**\n\n| Output | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `RELATED_SIEM_ALERTS` | Summary of SIEM alerts related to the IOC(s) |\n| `RELATED_CASES` | Summary of cases related to the IOC(s) |\n| `CORRELATION_STATUS` | Success/failure status of the correlation |\n| `MALICIOUS_CONFIDENCE` | Derived confidence based on alert history: `high`, `medium`, `low`, or `none` |\n\n## Use Cases\n\n1. **Before Investigation** - Check if IOC is already under investigation\n2. **During Enrichment** - Understand internal activity for an IOC\n3. **Threat Hunt** - Find all alerts/cases related to campaign indicators\n4. **Incident Response** - Identify scope of compromise across cases\n\n## Correlation Summary Template\n\n```\nIOC Correlation Summary for [IOC_LIST]:\n\nSIEM Alerts (last [TIME_FRAME_HOURS] hours):\n- Total alerts: [count]\n- Alert types: [list]\n- Affected hosts: [list]\n\nRelated Cases:\n- Open cases: [count] - [IDs]\n- Closed cases: [count]\n- Related investigations: [summary]\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:56.612Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Security Analysis Agents needing advanced threat detection and IOC correlation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级威胁检测和IOC关联功能的安全分析代理。","ja":"セキュリティ分析エージェントが高度な脅威検出およびIOC関連付け機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 위협 감지 및 IOC 연관 기능이 필요한 보안 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Seguridad que necesitan capacidades de detección de amenazas avanzadas y correlación de IOC.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Sécurité ayant besoin de capacités de détection de menaces avancées et de corrélation d''IOC.","de":"Perfekt für Sicherheitsanalyse-Agents, die erweiterte Bedrohungserkennung und IOC-Korrelationsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Segurança que necessitam de detecção de ameaças avançadas e capacidades de correlação de IOC.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов безопасности, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности обнаружения угроз и корреляции IOC.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل الأمن التي تحتاج إلى كشف التهديدات المتقدم وملاءمة القدرات IOC."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to correlate SIEM alerts with Indicators of Compromise (IOCs) such as IP addresses and domains, utilizing SOAR case filtering and customizable time frame analysis through parameters like TIME_FRAME_HOURS and SOAR_CASE_FILTER.","zh":"赋予代理关联SIEM警报与指标的妥协（IOCs），例如IP地址和域名，利用SOAR案例过滤和可自定义的时间范围分析，通过参数如TIME_FRAME_HOURS和SOAR_CASE_FILTER。","ja":"エージェントにSIEMアラートと指標の妥協（IOCs）を関連付けさせることができます。たとえば、IPアドレスやドメインを使用して、SOARケースのフィルタリングや、TIME_FRAME_HOURSやSOAR_CASE_FILTERなどのパラメータを使用した時間枠の分析を実行できます。","ko":"에이전트가 SIEM 경고와 위협 지표(IOCs)를 상관시킬 수 있도록 합니다. 예를 들어, IP 주소 및 도메인을 사용하여 SOAR 사례 필터링 및 TIME_FRAME_HOURS 및 SOAR_CASE_FILTER와 같은 매개 변수를 통해 사용자 지정 시간 프레임 분석을 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a correlacionar alertas de SIEM con Indicadores de Compromiso (IOCs) como direcciones IP y dominios, utilizando el filtrado de casos de SOAR y el análisis de marcos de tiempo personalizables a través de parámetros como TIME_FRAME_HOURS y SOAR_CASE_FILTER.","fr":"Permet aux agents de corréler les alertes SIEM avec les Indicateurs de Compromission (IOCs) tels que les adresses IP et les domaines, en utilisant le filtrage de cas SOAR et l''analyse de trames horaires personnalisables via des paramètres tels que TIME_FRAME_HOURS et SOAR_CASE_FILTER.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, SIEM-Alerts mit Indikatoren für Kompromisse (IOCs) wie IP-Adressen und Domänen zu korrelieren, indem sie das SOAR-Fallfiltern und die analysierbare Zeitrahmenanalyse über Parameter wie TIME_FRAME_HOURS und SOAR_CASE_FILTER nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a correlacionar alertas SIEM com Indicadores de Compromisso (IOCs), como endereços IP e domínios, utilizando o filtro de caso SOAR e análise de quadro de tempo personalizável por meio de parâmetros como TIME_FRAME_HOURS e SOAR_CASE_FILTER.","ru":"Позволяет агентам коррелировать предупреждения SIEM с индикаторами компрометации (IOC), такими как IP-адреса и домены, используя фильтрацию дел SOAR и настраиваемый анализ временного интервала с помощью параметров như TIME_FRAME_HOURS и SOAR_CASE_FILTER.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من مراقبة تنبيهات SIEM مع مؤشرات الاعتداء (IOCs) مثل عناوين IP والโดомен، باستخدام تصفية حالة SOAR وتحليل الإطار الزمني قابل للتعديل من خلال معلمات مثل TIME_FRAME_HOURS و SOAR_CASE_FILTER."},"useCases":{"en":["Correlating IOCs with existing SIEM alerts","Automating threat detection workflows","Enhancing incident response with IOC-based alert filtering"],"zh":["关联IOCs与现有的SIEM警报","自动化威胁检测工作流","使用IOC基于警报过滤增强事件响应"],"ja":["IOCsを既存のSIEMアラートと関連付け","脅威検出ワークフローを自動化","IOCベースのアラートフィルタリングを使用してインシデントレスポンスを強化"],"ko":["기존 SIEM 경고와 IOCs를 상관시키기","위협 감지 워크플ロー 자동화","IOC 기반 경고 필터링을 사용하여 인시던트 응답 강화"],"es":["Correlacionar IOCs con alertas de SIEM existentes","Automatizar flujos de trabajo de detección de amenazas","Mejorar la respuesta a incidentes con filtrado de alertas basado en IOC"],"fr":["Corréler les IOCs avec les alertes SIEM existantes","Automatiser les flux de travail de détection de menaces","Améliorer la réponse aux incidents avec un filtrage d''alertes basé sur les IOC"],"de":["IOCs mit vorhandenen SIEM-Alerts korrelieren","Bedrohungserkennungs-Workflows automatisieren","Vorfallreaktion durch IOC-basiertes Alert-Filtern verbessern"],"pt":["Correlacionar IOCs com alertas SIEM existentes","Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de detecção de ameaças","Melhorar a resposta a incidentes com filtragem de alertas com base em IOC"],"ru":["Сопоставление IOC с существующими предупреждениями SIEM","Автоматизация рабочих процессов обнаружения угроз","Улучшение реагирования на инциденты с помощью фильтрации предупреждений на основе IOC"],"ar":["مراقبة IOCs مع تنبيهات SIEM الحالية","تأتمة سير عمل كشف التهديد","تحسين الاستجابة للحوادث بفلاتر التنبيهات القائمة على IOC"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to SIEM alerts and cases","Dependent on quality and completeness of IOC lists"],"zh":["需要访问SIEM警报和案例","依赖于IOC列表的质量和完整性"],"ja":["SIEMアラートとケースへのアクセスが必要","IOCリストの品質と完全性に依存"],"ko":["SIEM 경고 및 사례에 대한 액세스가 필요함","IOC 목록의 품질 및 완전성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a alertas y casos de SIEM","Depende de la calidad y la complejidad de las listas de IOC"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux alertes et aux cas SIEM","Dépend de la qualité et de l''exhaustivité des listes d''IOC"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf SIEM-Alerts und -Fälle","Hängt von der Qualität und Vollständigkeit der IOC-Listen ab"],"pt":["Requer acesso a alertas e casos SIEM","Dependente da qualidade e completude das listas IOC"],"ru":["Требует доступа к предупреждениям и делам SIEM","Зависит от качества и полноты списков IOC"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى التنبيهات والحالات SIEM","يعتمد على جودة واستكمال قوائم IOC"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"a8effc146063954faeb0c41e42db25fa7c27e89f036165de3a50e1470eb16d77","qualityScore":51}');
