INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('sfc-gh-dflippo/snowflake-dbt-demo/doc-scraper', 'doc-scraper', 'sfc-gh-dflippo', 'snowflake-dbt-demo', 'community', 'doc-scraper sfc-gh-dflippo snowflake-dbt-demo community The doc-scraper skill simplifies Snowflake documentation management by scraping docs.snowflake.com sections to Markdown with SQLite caching. It benefits developers working with Snowflake Data Cloud and dbt. doc-scraper 是一个爬取 Snowflake 文档的工具，使用 SQLite 缓存以提高效率 doc-scraper は Snowflake ドキュメントをスクレイピングするツールで、SQLite キャッシュを使用して効率を高めています doc-scraper는 Snowflake 문서를 크롤링하는 도구로 SQLite 캐시를 사용하여 효율을 높입니다 doc-scraper es una herramienta para scraping de documentación de Snowflake con SQLite caching y compatibilidad con Python doc-scraper est un outil de scraping de documentation Snowflake avec mise en cache SQLite et prise en charge de Python doc-scraper ist ein Tool für das Scraping von Snowflake-Dokumentation mit SQLite-Caching und Python-Unterstützung O doc-scraper é uma ferramenta de extração de documentação do Snowflake que utiliza caching com SQLite e expiração de 7 dias. ИИ Агент doc-scraper - это инструмент для сбора документации Snowflake, который использует кэширование SQLite и истечением срока действия 7 дней. أداة doc-scraper هي أداة سحب وثائق سنوفليك المتقدمة التي تستخدم ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت SQLite وتنتهي صلاحيتها بعد 7 أيام. how to use doc-scraper doc-scraper setup guide Snowflake documentation scraper doc-scraper vs dbt doc-scraper install what is doc-scraper doc-scraper alternative doc-scraper and Snowflake Data Cloud doc-scraper Python script doc-scraper SQLite caching doc-scraper Snowflake 文档爬取 SQLite 缓存 AI 工具 命令行界面 数据抽取 文档爬取 Snowflake 数据云 dbt Scrapes docs.snowflake.com sections to Markdown format Utilizes SQLite caching with a 7-day expiration policy Supports customizable output directories via the --output-dir command option Allows for adjustable spider depth using the --spider-depth command option Auto-installs required dependencies, including uv and doc-scraper, on first-time setup Enables subsequent runs with simplified command-line interfaces doc-scraper is a Python-based tool that scrapes Snowflake documentation into Markdown format, utilizing SQLite caching for efficient data storage and retrieval.');
