INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('munlucky/moon-bot/implementation-runner', 'implementation-runner', 'munlucky', 'moon-bot', 'community', 'implementation-runner munlucky moon-bot community The implementation-runner skill automates implementation for AI agents, benefiting developers by streamlining the process. It checks requirements, defines change scope, and records changes. Implementation Runner 是一种自动化代码变更和实现的工具，支持分析上下文和决策技能链 Implementation Runner は、分析コンテキストと決定スキルチェーンをサポートするコード実装と変更を自動化するツールです Implementation Runner는 분석 컨텍스트와 결정 스킬 체인을 지원하는 자동화된 코드 변경과 구현 도구입니다 Implementation-runner es una skill técnica para agentes de IA que ejecuta cambios de código. Analiza el contexto de la solicitud, define el alcance de la implementación y genera un resumen de los archivos modificados, marcando la finalización en analysisContext. Implementation-runner est une compétence technique pour agents IA exécutant des modifications de code. Elle analyse le contexte de la requête, définit la portée des implémentations et génère un résumé des fichiers modifiés. Implementation-runner ist eine technische Fähigkeit für KI-Agenten, die Codeänderungen ausführt. Sie analysiert den Anfragekontext, definiert den Implementierungsumfang und erstellt eine Zusammenfassung der geänderten Dateien. O Implementation Runner é uma ferramenta de automação que analisa o contexto e implementa mudanças nos arquivos de código Implementation Runner - это инструмент автоматизации, который анализирует контекст и реализует изменения в файлах кода Implementation Runner هو أداة تلقائية لتحليل السياق وتنفيذ التغييرات في الملفات البرمجية how to use implementation-runner implementation-runner setup guide implementation-runner alternative implementation-runner vs competitor skills implementation-runner install what is implementation-runner automated implementation for AI agents analysisContext implementation repo data implementation Implementation Runner AI 工具 自动化代码变更 代码实现 分析上下文 决策技能链 Checks requirements and context using analysisContext.request.userMessage Defines change scope and implements changes based on analysisContext.decisions.skillChain Records changed files and key change summary in repo.changedFiles Updates implementation completion in analysisContext Utilizes repo.openFiles and analysisContext.artifacts.contextDocPath for context-aware implementation implementation-runner is a skill that automates the implementation process for AI agents, using inputs like analysisContext and repo data to define and record changes');
